und color for the checkout page. Color is applied to the <em>body</em> element.' => 'Dewiswch liw cefndir ar gyfer y dudalen ddesg dalu. Mae lliw yn cael ei gymhwyso i elfen y <em>corff</em> .','Footer background color' => 'Lliw cefndir y troedyn','Choose a background color for the checkout page footer. Only applies when using the distraction free header and footer.' => 'Dewiswch liw cefndir ar gyfer troedyn y dudalen ddesg dalu. Dim ond wrth ddefnyddio&#39;r pennyn a&#39;r troedyn heb dynnu sylw y mae&#39;n berthnasol.','Progress bar' => 'Bar cynnydd','Make the checkout progress bar stay visible while scrolling' => 'Gwnewch i&#39;r bar cynnydd til aros yn weladwy wrth sgrolio','Express checkout' => 'Desg dalu cyflym','Enable the express checkout section' => 'Galluogi&#39;r adran desg dalu cyflym','Displays the express checkout section at checkout when supported payment gateways have this feature enabled.' => 'Yn dangos yr adran desg dalu cyflym wrth y ddesg dalu pan fydd y nodwedd hon wedi&#39;i galluogi gan byrth talu â chymorth.','Display express checkout buttons in one line for larger screens' => 'Arddangos botymau desg dalu cyflym mewn un llinell ar gyfer sgriniau mwy','Ignore additional checkout required fields when paying with a compatible express checkout payment gateway' => 'Anwybyddwch feysydd talu ychwanegol wrth dalu gyda phorth talu desg dalu cyflym cydnaws','Make the order summary stay visible while scrolling' => 'Gwnewch i grynodeb y gorchymyn aros yn weladwy wrth sgrolio','Choose a background color for the order summary section.' => 'Dewiswch liw cefndir ar gyfer yr adran crynodeb archeb.','Highlight the order totals row in the order summary table' => 'Amlygwch y rhes cyfansymiau trefn yn y tabl crynodeb trefn','Most useful when the order summary section does not have a highlighted background color. Might also apply to the Cart, Order Received and View Order pages when using Fluid Checkout PRO.' => 'Yn fwyaf defnyddiol pan nad oes gan yr adran crynodeb trefn liw cefndir wedi&#39;i amlygu. Gallai hefyd fod yn berthnasol i&#39;r tudalennau Cert, Archeb a Dderbynnir a Gweld Archeb wrth ddefnyddio Fluid Checkout PRO.','Action link on the order summary at checkout.' => 'Dolen gweithredu ar grynodeb yr archeb wrth y ddesg dalu.','Edit cart link' => 'Golygu dolen cart','Cart items count' => 'Mae eitemau cart yn cyfrif','Link to shop page' => 'Dolen i dudalen siop','Cart items' => 'Eitemau cert','Hide cart items errors at the checkout page' => 'Cuddio gwallau eitemau cart ar y dudalen ddesg dalu','Do not display the cart items errors message at the top of the checkout page. When submitting the checkout form to complete the purchase, these error messages will always be displayed.' => 'Peidiwch ag arddangos y neges gwallau eitemau cart ar frig y dudalen ddesg dalu. Wrth gyflwyno&#39;r ffurflen ddesg dalu i gwblhau&#39;r pryniant, bydd y negeseuon gwall hyn bob amser yn cael eu harddangos.','Place order' => 'Rhowch archeb','Define the position to display "Place order" and terms checkbox section.' => 'Diffiniwch y sefyllfa i arddangos &quot;Trefn lle&quot; a thelerau adran blwch ticio.','Some options might not be compatible with some plugins and themes.' => 'Efallai na fydd rhai opsiynau yn gydnaws â rhai ategion a themâu.','Below the payment section' => 'Isod yr adran talu','Below the order summary' => 'Isod y crynodeb archeb','Both below the payment section and the order summary' => 'Mae&#39;r ddau islaw&#39;r adran dalu a chrynodeb yr archeb','Add widget areas to the checkout page' => 'Ychwanegu ardaloedd teclyn i&#39;r dudalen ddesg dalu','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the checkout page.' => 'Defnyddir yr ardaloedd teclyn hyn i ychwanegu symbolau ymddiriedaeth a bathodynnau ymddiriedaeth ar y dudalen ddesg dalu.','Display the coupon codes section title' => 'Dangoswch deitl yr adran codau cwpon','Select position where to display the coupon codes section on the checkout page.' => 'Dewiswch leoliad lle i arddangos yr adran codau cwpon ar y dudalen ddesg dalu.','Before the checkout steps' => 'Cyn y camau til','As a substep before payment methods' => 'Fel is-gam cyn dulliau talu','As a substep after payment methods' => 'Fel is-gam ar ôl dulliau talu','Default button style' => 'Arddull botwm diofyn','"Add" link button' => 'Botwm cyswllt &quot;Ychwanegu&quot;.','Checkout fields' => 'Meysydd desg dalu','Optional fields' => 'Meysydd dewisol','Hide optional fields behind a link button' => 'Cuddio meysydd dewisol y tu ôl i fotwm cyswllt','It is recommended to keep this option checked to reduce the number of open input fields, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#1-address-line-2--company-name-can-safely-be-collapsed-behind-a-link" target="_blank">read the research</a>.' => 'Argymhellir cadw&#39;r opsiwn hwn wedi&#39;i wirio i leihau nifer y meysydd mewnbwn agored, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#1-address-line-2--company-name-can-safely-be-collapsed-behind-a-link" target="_blank">darllenwch yr ymchwil</a> .','Do not hide "Address line 2" fields behind a link button' => 'Peidiwch â chuddio meysydd &quot;Llinell cyfeiriad 2&quot; y tu ôl i fotwm cyswllt','Recommended only when most customers actually need the "Address line 2" field, or when getting the right shipping address is crucial (ie. if delivering food and other perishable products).' => 'Argymhellir dim ond pan fo&#39;r rhan fwyaf o gwsmeriaid mewn gwirionedd angen y maes &quot;Llinell Cyfeiriad 2&quot;, neu pan fydd cael y cyfeiriad cludo cywir yn hanfodol (hy os ydynt yn danfon bwyd a chynhyrchion darfodus eraill).','Billing address' => 'Cyfeiriad bilio','Select position where to display the billing address section on the checkout page.' => 'Dewiswch safle lle i arddangos yr adran cyfeiriad bilio ar y dudalen ddesg dalu.','As a step before shipping' => 'Fel cam cyn llongau','As a sub-step before the shipping address section' => 'Fel is-gam cyn yr adran cyfeiriad llongau','As a sub-step after the shipping address section' => 'Fel is-gam ar ôl yr adran cyfeiriad llongau','As a step after shipping' => 'Fel cam ar ôl cludo','As a sub-step before the payment section' => 'Fel is-gam cyn yr adran dalu','Force billing and shipping addresses to the same (single section)' => 'Gorfodi cyfeiriadau bilio a chludo i&#39;r un peth (adran sengl)','Checkbox for "Same as shipping/billing address" checked by default' => 'Blwch ticio ar gyfer &quot;Yr un fath â&#39;r cyfeiriad cludo / bilio&quot; wedi&#39;i wirio yn ddiofyn','The checkbox "Same as shiping address" will start as checked by default when the shipping address section is displayed first. <br>The checkbox "Same as billing address" will start as checked by default when the billing address section is displayed first. <br> It is recommended to leave this option checked as to significantly reduce the number of open input fields at checkout, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#3-default-billing--shipping-and-hide-the-fields-entirely" target="_blank">read the research</a>.' => 'Bydd y blwch ticio &quot;Yr un fath â&#39;r cyfeiriad cludo&quot; yn dechrau fel y&#39;i gwiriwyd yn ddiofyn pan fydd yr adran cyfeiriad cludo yn cael ei harddangos gyntaf.<br> Bydd y blwch ticio &quot;Yr un fath â&#39;r cyfeiriad bilio&quot; yn dechrau fel y&#39;i gwiriwyd yn ddiofyn pan fydd yr adran cyfeiriad bilio yn cael ei harddangos gyntaf.<br> Argymhellir gadael yr opsiwn hwn wedi&#39;i wirio i leihau&#39;n sylweddol nifer y meysydd mewnbwn agored wrth y ddesg dalu, <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/checkout-flow-average-form-fields#3-default-billing--shipping-and-hide-the-fields-entirely" target="_blank">darllenwch yr ymchwil</a> .','Highlight the billing address section in the checkout form' => 'Tynnwch sylw at yr adran cyfeiriad bilio yn y ffurflen ddesg dalu','Shipping address' => 'Cyfeiriad cludo','Highlight the shipping address section in the checkout form' => 'Tynnwch sylw at yr adran cyfeiriad cludo yn y ffurflen ddesg dalu','Shipping methods' => 'Dulliau cludo','Choose in which position to display the shipping methods section.' => 'Dewiswch ym mha safle i arddangos yr adran dulliau cludo.','Before shipping address' => 'Cyfeiriad cyn cludo','After shipping address' => 'Ar ôl cyfeiriad cludo','Local pickup' => 'Pickup lleol','Removes shipping address section when a local pickup shipping method is selected.' => 'Yn dileu&#39;r adran cyfeiriad cludo pan ddewisir dull cludo casglu lleol.','Replaces the shipping address with the pickup point location when a local pickup shipping method is selected.' => 'Yn disodli&#39;r cyfeiriad cludo gyda lleoliad y pwynt codi pan ddewisir dull cludo lleol.','Choose which address to save as the shipping address for local pickup orders.' => 'Dewiswch pa gyfeiriad i&#39;w gadw fel y cyfeiriad cludo ar gyfer archebion casglu lleol.','Save the selected pickup location' => 'Arbedwch y lleoliad casglu a ddewiswyd','Save same as the billing address' => 'Arbedwch yr un peth â&#39;r cyfeiriad bilio','Do not save any shipping address' => 'Peidiwch ag arbed unrhyw gyfeiriad cludo','Company name field for shipping address' => 'Maes enw cwmni ar gyfer cyfeiriad cludo','Change visibility for the company name field for the shipping address section on the checkout form.' => 'Newid gwelededd ar gyfer maes enw&#39;r cwmni ar gyfer yr adran cyfeiriad cludo ar y ffurflen ddesg dalu.','If field is set as "optional", which is the default visibility state, no changes will be applied to let other plugins apply any changes they need.' => 'Os yw&#39;r maes wedi&#39;i osod fel &quot;dewisol&quot;, sef y cyflwr gwelededd rhagosodedig, ni fydd unrhyw newidiadau yn cael eu cymhwyso i adael i ategion eraill gymhwyso unrhyw newidiadau sydd eu hangen arnynt.','Hidden (remove field)' => 'Cudd (tynnwch y maes)','Optional' => 'Dewisol','Required' => 'Angenrheidiol','Add shipping phone field to the checkout form.' => 'Ychwanegu maes ffôn cludo i&#39;r ffurflen ddesg dalu.','Choose in which step to display the shipping phone field.' => 'Dewiswch ym mha gam i arddangos y maes ffôn cludo.','Contact step' => 'Cam cyswllt','Billing phone' => 'Ffôn bilio','Add billing phone field to the checkout form.' => 'Ychwanegu maes ffôn bilio at y ffurflen ddesg dalu.','Choose in which step to display the billing phone field.' => 'Dewiswch ym mha gam i arddangos y maes ffôn bilio.','Show country code beside the flag' => 'Dangos cod gwlad wrth ymyl y faner','Show an example of a valid phone number inside phone fields' => 'Dangoswch enghraifft o rif ffôn dilys y tu mewn i feysydd ffôn','Do not change placeholders' => 'Peidiwch â newid dalfannau','Show if not defined' => 'Dangoswch os nad yw wedi&#39;i ddiffinio','Always show' => 'Dangoswch bob amser','Order notes' => 'Nodiadau archebu','Define the visibility of the additional order notes field.' => 'Diffiniwch welededd y maes nodiadau archeb ychwanegol.','Gift options' => 'Opsiynau rhodd','Allow customers to add a gift message and other gift related options to the order.' => 'Caniatáu i gwsmeriaid ychwanegu neges anrheg ac opsiynau eraill sy&#39;n gysylltiedig â rhoddion at yr archeb.','Display the gift message as part of the order details table instead of a separate section' => 'Dangoswch y neges anrheg fel rhan o dabl manylion yr archeb yn lle adran ar wahân','This option affects the order confirmation page (thank you page) and order details on account pages, emails and packing slips.' => 'Mae&#39;r opsiwn hwn yn effeithio ar y dudalen cadarnhau archeb (tudalen diolch) a manylion archebu ar dudalennau cyfrifon, e-byst a slipiau pacio.','Account matching' => 'Paru cyfrif','Enable the account matching feature' => 'Galluogi&#39;r nodwedd paru cyfrif','Associate the guest customer\'s orders with their existing account when an account already exists with the customer\'s contact details.' => 'Cysylltwch archebion y cwsmer gwadd â&#39;u cyfrif presennol pan fo cyfrif eisoes yn bodoli gyda manylion cyswllt y cwsmer.','Display message when an account exists with the email address provided' => 'Dangos neges pan fydd cyfrif yn bodoli gyda&#39;r cyfeiriad e-bost a ddarparwyd','Replaces the account creation fields with a notification and option to log in. In some contexts, it might be recommended to leave this option disabled to protect the privacy of customers.' => 'Yn disodli&#39;r meysydd creu cyfrif gyda hysbysiad ac opsiwn i fewngofnodi. Mewn rhai cyd-destunau, efallai yr argymhellir gadael yr opsiwn hwn wedi&#39;i analluogi er mwyn diogelu preifatrwydd cwsmeriaid.','Dashboard' => 'Dangosfwrdd','Integrations' => 'Integreiddiadau','License keys' => 'Allweddi trwydded','Visit our website for more information about our plugins and add-ons.' => 'Ewch i&#39;n gwefan i gael rhagor o wybodaeth am ein ategion ac ychwanegion.','Order pay page' => 'Archebwch dudalen talu','Order pay' => 'Archebu tâl','Enable order pay page optimizations' => 'Galluogi optimeiddio tudalennau talu archeb','Changes the layout of order pay page for existing orders pending payment from the customer.' => 'Yn newid cynllun tudalen dalu archeb ar gyfer archebion presennol tra&#39;n aros am daliad gan y cwsmer.','Add widget areas to the order pay page' => 'Ychwanegu ardaloedd teclyn i&#39;r dudalen talu archeb','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the order pay page.' => 'Defnyddir yr ardaloedd teclyn hyn i ychwanegu symbolau ymddiriedaeth a bathodynnau ymddiriedaeth ar y dudalen talu archeb.','Thank you page & order details layout' => 'Tudalen diolch a gosodiad manylion archeb','Order details optimizations' => 'Gorchymyn optimeiddio manylion','Enable thank you page and order details optimizations' => 'Galluogi optimeiddio tudalen diolch a manylion archebu','Changes the layout of order details on the thank you page and account pages.' => 'Yn newid cynllun manylion archeb ar y dudalen diolch a thudalennau cyfrif.','Enable order details customizations on email notifications' => 'Galluogi addasiadau manylion archeb ar hysbysiadau e-bost','Display new sections and change order of sections on email notifications. Styles of order details on email notifications remain unchanged.' => 'Arddangos adrannau newydd a newid trefn adrannau ar hysbysiadau e-bost. Mae arddulliau manylion archeb ar hysbysiadau e-bost yn parhau heb eu newid.','Thank you page' => 'Tudalen diolch','These options affect the thank you page, also known as order received or order confirmation pages.' => 'Mae&#39;r opsiynau hyn yn effeithio ar y dudalen diolch, a elwir hefyd yn dudalennau cadarnhad archeb neu archeb.','Order details layout' => 'Cynllun manylion archeb','Display the order details with wide layout on the thank you page' => 'Dangoswch fanylion yr archeb gyda chynllun eang ar y dudalen diolch','Add widget areas to the thank you page' => 'Ychwanegu ardaloedd teclyn i&#39;r dudalen diolch','These widget areas are used to add trust symbols and trust badges on the thank you page.' => 'Defnyddir yr ardaloedd teclyn hyn i ychwanegu symbolau ymddiriedaeth a bathodynnau ymddiriedaeth ar y dudalen diolch.','Order actions' => 'Gorchymyn gweithredoedd','Choose in which position to display the order actions.' => 'Dewiswch ym mha safle i arddangos gweithredoedd y drefn.','Inside the order overview' => 'Y tu mewn i&#39;r trosolwg gorchymyn','After the order overview' => 'Ar ôl trosolwg y gorchymyn','After order sections' => 'Adrannau ar ôl gorchymyn','Order status' => 'Statws archeb','Display the order status progress bar' => 'Dangoswch y bar cynnydd statws archeb','Choose in which position to display the section.' => 'Dewiswch ym mha safle i arddangos yr adran.','After the order overview and payment instructions' => 'Ar ôl y trosolwg archeb a chyfarwyddiadau talu','Before the order items section' => 'Cyn yr adran eitemau archeb','Inside the order items section' => 'Y tu mewn i&#39;r adran eitemau archeb','After the order items section' => 'Ar ôl yr adran eitemau archeb','On the sidebar' => 'Ar y bar ochr','Order downloads' => 'Archebwch lawrlwythiadau','Gift message' => 'Neges anrheg','Tools' => 'Offer','Troubleshooting' => 'Datrys problemau','Debug options' => 'Opsiynau dadfygio','Debug mode' => 'Modd dadfygio','Using debug mode affects the website performance. Only use this option while troubleshooting.' => 'Mae defnyddio modd dadfygio yn effeithio ar berfformiad y wefan. Defnyddiwch yr opsiwn hwn wrth ddatrys problemau yn unig.','Load unminified assets' => 'Llwytho asedau heb eu miniogi','Enhanced select fields' => 'Gwell meysydd dethol','Fix automatic zoom-in on form fields' => 'Trwsio chwyddo awtomatig ar feysydd ffurflen','Set <code>font-size</code> inside form fields to 16px' => 'Gosod <code>font-size</code> y tu mewn i feysydd ffurflen i 16px','Fluid Checkout' => 'Desg Hylif','Settings' => 'Gosodiadau','Support' => 'Cefnogaeth','(PRO)' => '(PRO)','(experimental)' => '(arbrofol)','Please verify your phone number.' => 'Gwiriwch eich rhif ffôn.','The Bluehost Plugin' => 'Yr Ategyn Bluehost','Custom fields' => 'Meysydd personol','Enable custom shipping email field' => 'Galluogi maes e-bost cludo personol','When enabled, the shipping email field from the Bluehost plugin will be added to the checkout form.' => 'Pan fydd wedi&#39;i alluogi, bydd y maes e-bost cludo o&#39;r ategyn Bluehost yn cael ei ychwanegu at y ffurflen ddesg dalu.','Captcha Pro by BestWebSoft' => 'Captcha Pro gan BestWebSoft','Captcha position' => 'Safle Captcha','Define the position to display the captcha section. Some positions might not work depending on the captcha type chosen.' => 'Diffiniwch y safle i arddangos yr adran captcha. Efallai na fydd rhai swyddi&#39;n gweithio yn dibynnu ar y math captcha a ddewiswyd.','Selecting a pickup point is required before proceeding.' => 'Mae angen dewis man codi cyn symud ymlaen.','Pickup point' => 'Pwynt codi','Pickup point not selected yet.' => 'Nid yw&#39;r pwynt codi wedi&#39;i ddewis eto.','Pickup point:' => 'Man codi:','Mailchimp for WooCommerce' => 'Mailchimp ar gyfer WooCommerce','Subscribe checkbox' => 'Tanysgrifio blwch ticio','Override the position for the subscribe checkbox on the checkout page and always display it on the contact step' => 'Diystyrwch y sefyllfa ar gyfer y blwch ticio tanysgrifio ar y dudalen ddesg dalu a&#39;i arddangos bob amser ar y cam cyswllt','Before Shipping Address' => 'Cyfeiriad Cyn Cludo','(originally "%s")' => '(yn wreiddiol &quot;%s&quot;)','After Shipping Address' => 'Ar ôl Cyfeiriad Llongau','Selecting a collection point is required when shipping with FermoPoint.' => 'Mae angen dewis man casglu wrth anfon nwyddau gyda FermoPoint.','If checked informs typos in email to users. (This feature has been disabled because Fluid Checkout offers the feature. Changes to this option will not take effect)' => 'Os caiff ei wirio, mae&#39;n rhoi gwybod i ddefnyddwyr teipio mewn e-bost. (Mae&#39;r nodwedd hon wedi&#39;i hanalluogi oherwydd bod Fluid Checkout yn cynnig y nodwedd. Ni fydd newidiadau i&#39;r opsiwn hwn yn dod i rym)','Enable Mail Check: (disabled feature)' => 'Galluogi Gwirio Post: (nodwedd anabl)','Carrier:' => 'Cludwr:','Sendinblue - WooCommerce Email Marketing' => 'Sendinblue - Marchnata E-bost WooCommerce','Sign up checkbox position' => 'Cofrestrwch safle blwch ticio','Move the sign up checkbox to the contact step' => 'Symudwch y blwch ticio cofrestru i&#39;r cam cyswllt','When enabled, the checkbox will be moved to the contact step independently of the display location defined in the Sendinblue plugin settings.' => 'Pan fydd wedi&#39;i alluogi, bydd y blwch ticio yn cael ei symud i&#39;r cam cyswllt yn annibynnol ar y lleoliad arddangos a ddiffinnir yn y gosodiadau ategyn Sendinblue.','Theme Betheme' => 'Thema Betheme','Checkout progress' => 'Cynnydd til','Output the checkout steps section from Betheme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => 'Allbynnu&#39;r adran camau desg dalu o Betheme ar y tudalennau desg dalu, cert ac archeb a dderbyniwyd.','Theme Fennik' => 'Thema Fennik','Breadcrumbs' => 'Briwsion bara','Output the breadcrumbs section from the Fennik theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => 'Allbynnu&#39;r adran briwsion bara o&#39;r thema Fennik wrth ddefnyddio pennyn a throedyn Desg Fluid.','Theme Go' => 'Thema Ewch','My account layout' => 'Cynllun fy nghyfrif','Enable wide layout on "My account" page.' => 'Galluogi gosodiad eang ar dudalen &quot;Fy nghyfrif&quot;.','Theme Impreza' => 'Impreza Thema','Header' => 'Pennawd','Spacing for site header at the checkout page (in pixels)' => 'Bylchau ar gyfer pennyn y wefan ar y dudalen ddesg dalu (mewn picseli)','Only applicable when using the Impreza theme header at the checkout page.' => 'Dim ond yn berthnasol wrth ddefnyddio pennawd thema Impreza ar y dudalen ddesg dalu.','Theme Kapee' => 'Thema Kapee','Output the checkout steps section from the Kapee theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => 'Allbynnu&#39;r adran camau desg dalu o thema Kapee ar y tudalennau desg dalu, cert ac archeb a dderbyniwyd.','Theme Porto' => 'Thema Porto','Output the checkout steps section from the Porto theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => 'Allbynnu&#39;r adran camau desg dalu o&#39;r thema Porto ar y tudalennau desg dalu, cert ac archeb a dderbyniwyd.','Theme Pressmart' => 'Thema Pressmart','Output the checkout steps section from the Pressmart theme on the checkout, cart and order received pages.' => 'Allbynnu&#39;r adran camau desg dalu o&#39;r thema Pressmart ar y tudalennau desg dalu, cert ac archeb a dderbyniwyd.','Theme The Gem' => 'Thema Y Gem','Output the checkout steps section from The Gem theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => 'Allbynnu&#39;r adran camau til o thema The Gem wrth ddefnyddio pennyn a throedyn Desg Fluid.','Theme Woodmart' => 'Thema Woodmart','Output the checkout steps section from the Woodmart theme when using Fluid Checkout header and footer.' => 'Allbynnu&#39;r adran camau desg dalu o thema Woodmart wrth ddefnyddio pennyn a throedyn Desg Fluid.','Checkout options' => 'Opsiynau desg dalu','Disable the theme checkout options' => 'Analluoga&#39;r opsiynau til thema','The options display product image, quantity field, remove button and link to product page added by the theme are disabled by default.' => 'Mae&#39;r opsiynau sy&#39;n dangos delwedd cynnyrch, maes maint, botwm tynnu a dolen i dudalen cynnyrch a ychwanegwyd gan y thema wedi&#39;u hanalluogi yn ddiofyn.','Theme Atomion' => 'Thema Atomion','Order progress' => 'Archebu cynnydd','Display order progress from the theme' => 'Arddangos cynnydd archeb o&#39;r thema','Display the form field labels visible on the page' => 'Dangoswch y labeli maes ffurflen sydd i&#39;w gweld ar y dudalen','It is recommended to keep this option enabled for a better user experience.' => 'Argymhellir cadw&#39;r opsiwn hwn wedi&#39;i alluogi ar gyfer gwell profiad defnyddiwr.','Theme ZK Nito' => 'Thema ZK Nito','Add extra fields to the checkout form' => 'Ychwanegu meysydd ychwanegol at y ffurflen ddesg dalu','Adds an extra shipping email and shipping phone field to the shipping address section.' => 'Yn ychwanegu e-bost cludo ychwanegol a maes ffôn cludo i&#39;r adran cyfeiriad cludo.','Go to the home page' => 'Ewch i&#39;r dudalen gartref','Skip to content' => 'Neidio i&#39;r cynnwys','Create an account' => 'Creu cyfrif','Log in to your account' => 'Mewngofnodwch i&#39;ch cyfrif','Already have an account?' => 'Oes gennych chi gyfrif yn barod?','Logged in as %1$s. <a href="%2$s">Log out</a>' => 'Wedi mewngofnodi fel %1$s. <a href="%2$s">Allgofnodi</a>','Your order has a total amount due of %s. No further payment is needed.' => 'Mae gan eich archeb gyfanswm dyledus o %s. Nid oes angen taliad pellach.','Close and continue with checkout' => 'Cau a pharhau gyda&#39;r ddesg dalu','Continue' => 'Parhau','Parcel terminal' => 'Terfynell parsel','<p>This widget has been replaced by Fluid Checkout. </p><p>When using Fluid Checkout, the checkout page needs to use the original WooCommerce shortcode <code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code> to work properly.</p><p>For more information, visit the Fluid Checkout documentation.</p>' => '<p>Mae&#39;r teclyn hwn wedi&#39;i ddisodli gan Fluid Checkout.</p><p> Wrth ddefnyddio Fluid Checkout, mae angen i&#39;r dudalen ddesg dalu ddefnyddio&#39;r cod byr WooCommerce gwreiddiol <code>[woocommerce_checkout]</code> i weithio&#39;n iawn.</p><p> I gael rhagor o wybodaeth, ewch i&#39;r ddogfennaeth Desg Fluid.</p>','Theme The7' => 'Thema The7','Additional header sections' => 'Adrannau pennawd ychwanegol','Output additional header sections if enabled in the theme settings.' => 'Allbwn adrannau pennyn ychwanegol os yw wedi&#39;i alluogi yn y gosodiadau thema.','More information' => 'Mwy o wybodaeth','Pick a Locker' => 'Dewiswch Locer','Page template' => 'Templed tudalen','Use `Order confirmation` page template for block-based themes' => 'Defnyddiwch dempled tudalen `Cadarnhau archeb` ar gyfer themâu sy&#39;n seiliedig ar flociau','Only applies when using a block-based theme.' => 'Dim ond yn berthnasol wrth ddefnyddio thema sy&#39;n seiliedig ar flociau.','WooCommerce Stripe Gateway' => 'Porth Stripe WooCommerce','Payment form' => 'Ffurflen dalu','Apply styles to the Stripe payment form fields' => 'Cymhwyso arddulliau i feysydd ffurflen dalu Stripe','When enabled, Fluid Checkout will apply styles optimized for compatibility with the plugin. You may want to disable this if you are using custom styles for the Stripe payment form fields.' => 'Pan fydd wedi&#39;i alluogi, bydd Fluid Checkout yn defnyddio arddulliau sydd wedi&#39;u optimeiddio ar gyfer cydnawsedd â&#39;r ategyn. Efallai yr hoffech analluogi hyn os ydych chi&#39;n defnyddio arddulliau personol ar gyfer meysydd ffurflen dalu Stripe.','Theme Nyture' => 'Thema Nyture','Output the checkout steps section from the Nyture theme when using Fluid Checkout.' => 'Allbynnu&#39;r adran camau talu o&#39;r thema Nyture wrth ddefnyddio Fluid Checkout.','Allows customers to make payments for orders that are either created manually by the store admin or not completed during checkout.' => 'Yn caniatáu i gwsmeriaid wneud taliadau am archebion sydd naill ai wedi&#39;u creu â llaw gan weinyddwr y siop neu heb eu cwblhau yn ystod y ddesg dalu.','The plugin WooCommerce Checkout Manager by Quadlayers is not compatible with Fluid Checkout' => 'Nid yw&#39;r ategyn WooCommerce Checkout Manager gan Quadlayers yn gydnaws â Fluid Checkout','Company name field for billing address' => 'Maes enw cwmni ar gyfer cyfeiriad bilio','Change visibility for the company name field for the billing address section on the checkout form.' => 'Newid gwelededd ar gyfer maes enw&#39;r cwmni ar gyfer yr adran cyfeiriad bilio ar y ffurflen dalu.','Theme Bookshelf' => 'Silff Lyfrau Thema','Output the checkout steps section from the Bookshelf theme when using Fluid Checkout.' => 'Allbynnu&#39;r adran camau talu o&#39;r thema Silff Lyfrau wrth ddefnyddio Fluid Checkout.','Account password' => 'Cyfrinair y cyfrif','An account will be created with the information provided at checkout when completing the order.' => 'Bydd cyfrif yn cael ei greu gyda&#39;r wybodaeth a ddarperir wrth y ddesg dalu wrth gwblhau&#39;r archeb.','Choose the style of the progress bar.' => 'Dewiswch arddull y bar cynnydd.','Bars' => 'Bariau','Theme Ireca' => 'Thema Ireca','WooCommerce page layout' => 'Cynllun tudalen WooCommerce','Force wide layout on WooCommerce pages' => 'Gorfodi cynllun eang ar dudalennau WooCommerce','This ensures the content section is not too narrow on WooCommerce pages including checkout, cart, order received, order pay and account pages.' => 'Mae hyn yn sicrhau nad yw&#39;r adran gynnwys yn rhy gul ar dudalennau WooCommerce gan gynnwys tudalennau talu, basged, archeb a dderbyniwyd, talu archeb a chyfrif.','WooCommerce Smart Coupons' => 'Cwponau Clyfar WooCommerce','Position on checkout page' => 'Safle ar y dudalen talu','Choose where to display the available coupons section on the checkout page.' => 'Dewiswch ble i arddangos yr adran cwponau sydd ar gael ar y dudalen dalu.','Before the progress bar' => 'Cyn y bar cynnydd','After the progress bar' => 'Ar ôl y bar cynnydd','Before coupon codes section' => 'Cyn yr adran codau cwpon','Format phone numbers according to the rules for each country.' => 'Fformatiwch rifau ffôn yn ôl y rheolau ar gyfer pob gwlad.','Use precise phone number validation' => 'Defnyddiwch ddilysu rhif ffôn manwl gywir','This is an experimental feature and may not work as expected in all setups. Use it with caution.' => 'Nodwedd arbrofol yw hon ac efallai na fydd yn gweithio fel y disgwylir ym mhob gosodiad. Defnyddiwch hi&#39;n ofalus.','Phone number validation types used when precise validation is enabled.' => 'Mathau dilysu rhifau ffôn a ddefnyddir pan fydd dilysu manwl gywir wedi&#39;i alluogi.','Mobile' => 'Symudol','Fixed line' => 'Llinell sefydlog','Toll free' => 'Rhadffôn','Or' => 'Neu','Contact' => 'Cyswllt','Multi step' => 'Aml-gam','2 columns' => '2 golofn','1 column' => '1 golofn','Before checkout steps' => 'Camau cyn talu','When using the <em>"1 column"</em> checkout layout this option is always set to <em>"Before checkout steps"</em> and also applies to desktop view.' => 'Wrth ddefnyddio&#39;r cynllun talu <em>&quot;1 colofn&quot;</em> mae&#39;r opsiwn hwn bob amser wedi&#39;i osod i <em>&quot;Camau cyn talu&quot;</em> ac mae hefyd yn berthnasol i&#39;r olygfa bwrdd gwaith.','Position for the extra order summary section on mobile.' => 'Safle ar gyfer yr adran crynodeb archebion ychwanegol ar ffôn symudol.','The option <em>"On the site header"</em> only applies when using the distraction-free header.' => 'Dim ond wrth ddefnyddio&#39;r pennawd di-wrthdynnu y mae&#39;r opsiwn <em>&quot;Ar y pennawd safle&quot;</em> yn berthnasol.','On the site header (requires distraction-free header)' => 'Pennawd ar y wefan (angen pennawd di-wrthdynnu)','Initial state for the expansible order summary section on mobile.' => 'Cyflwr cychwynnol yr adran crynodeb archeb ehanguadwy ar ffôn symudol.','We recommend setting it as <em>expanded</em> for the following countries due to regulatory requirements: <strong>Germany</strong>, <strong>Austria</strong>, <strong>Switzerland</strong>, <strong>Netherlands</strong>, <strong>Poland</strong>, <strong>Belgium</strong> and <strong>France</strong>.' => 'Rydym yn argymell ei osod fel <em>wedi&#39;i ehangu</em> ar gyfer y gwledydd canlynol oherwydd gofynion rheoleiddio: <strong>yr Almaen</strong> , <strong>Awstria</strong> , <strong>y Swistir</strong> , <strong>yr Iseldiroedd</strong> , <strong>Gwlad Pwyl</strong> , <strong>Gwlad Belg</strong> a <strong>Ffrainc</strong> .','Collapsed' => 'Wedi cwympo','Expanded' => 'Wedi&#39;i ehangu','Do not show' => 'Peidiwch â dangos','yes' => 'ie','The shipping phone field may be forced as "required" if the billing address section is displayed after the shipping address section, and the billing phone field is set as "required". This is needed to ensure the shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout form.' => 'Gellir gorfodi&#39;r maes ffôn cludo fel &quot;angenrheidiol&quot; os yw&#39;r adran cyfeiriad bilio yn cael ei harddangos ar ôl yr adran cyfeiriad cludo, a bod y maes ffôn bilio wedi&#39;i osod fel &quot;angenrheidiol&quot;. Mae angen hyn i sicrhau y gellir copïo&#39;r cyfeiriad cludo i&#39;r cyfeiriad bilio pan fydd yr opsiwn hwnnw wedi&#39;i dicio, fel arall efallai na fydd y cwsmer yn gallu cwblhau&#39;r ffurflen dalu.','The billing phone field may be forced as "required" if the billing address section is displayed before the shipping address section, and the shipping phone field is set as "required". This is needed to ensure the shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout form.' => 'Gellir gorfodi&#39;r maes ffôn bilio fel &quot;angenrheidiol&quot; os yw&#39;r adran cyfeiriad bilio yn cael ei harddangos cyn yr adran cyfeiriad cludo, a bod y maes ffôn cludo wedi&#39;i osod fel &quot;angenrheidiol&quot;. Mae angen hyn i sicrhau y gellir copïo&#39;r cyfeiriad cludo i&#39;r cyfeiriad bilio pan fydd yr opsiwn hwnnw wedi&#39;i dicio, fel arall efallai na fydd y cwsmer yn gallu cwblhau&#39;r ffurflen dalu.','Settings profiles' => 'Proffiliau gosodiadau','Settings profile' => 'Proffil gosodiadau','You do not have permission to perform this action.' => 'Nid oes gennych ganiatâd i gyflawni&#39;r weithred hon.','You do not have permission to activate plugins.' => 'Nid oes gennych ganiatâd i actifadu ategion.','Missing plugin.' => 'Ategyn ar goll.','Plugin activated.' => 'Ategyn wedi&#39;i actifadu.','The following changes will be applied:' => 'Bydd y newidiadau canlynol yn cael eu cymhwyso:','Delete leftover options' => 'Dileu opsiynau sy&#39;n weddill','This preview has expired. Reload the admin page to start a new preview.' => 'Mae&#39;r rhagolwg hwn wedi dod i ben. Ail-lwythwch y dudalen weinyddol i ddechrau rhagolwg newydd.','Preview expired' => 'Rhagolwg wedi dod i ben','Orders cannot be placed in the preview.' => 'Ni ellir gosod archebion yn y rhagolwg.','Logging in is not available in the preview.' => 'Nid yw mewngofnodi ar gael yn y rhagolwg.','Accounts cannot be created in the preview.' => 'Ni ellir creu cyfrifon yn y rhagolwg.','Requests to other sites are blocked in the preview.' => 'Mae ceisiadau i wefannau eraill wedi&#39;u rhwystro yn y rhagolwg.','Processing…' => 'Yn prosesu…','Something went wrong. Please try again.' => 'Aeth rhywbeth o&#39;i le. Rhowch gynnig arall arni.','Activate plugin' => 'Actifadu&#39;r ategyn','Fluid Checkout PRO - The complete checkout package' => 'Fluid Checkout PRO - Y pecyn talu cyflawn','All PRO features + all add-ons, one price. Design templates, optimized cart and order received pages, account matching, and much more.' => 'Pob nodwedd PRO + pob ychwanegiad, un pris. Templedi dylunio, tudalennau basged a archebion wedi&#39;u optimeiddio, paru cyfrifon, a llawer mwy.','Optimized order pay page' => 'Tudalen talu archeb wedi&#39;i optimeiddio','Delayed account creation' => 'Creu cyfrif wedi&#39;i ohirio','Address autocomplete with Google Maps APIs' => 'Cwblhau cyfeiriadau&#39;n awtomatig gydag APIs Google Maps','Multiple saved addresses with the address book' => 'Cyfeiriadau lluosog wedi&#39;u cadw gyda&#39;r llyfr cyfeiriadau','EU-VAT assistant' => 'Cynorthwyydd TAW yr UE','Hide this section' => 'Cuddio&#39;r adran hon','Learn more' => 'Dysgu mwy','Get early access' => 'Cael mynediad cynnar','Activate add-on' => 'Actifadu&#39;r ychwanegiad','Get more out of your checkout journey' => 'Cael mwy allan o&#39;ch taith talu','Test API key' => 'Allwedd API Prawf','Guided setup' => 'Gosod dan arweiniad','Options' => 'Dewisiadau','Set up layout and design on the <a href="%s">checkout options</a>.' => 'Gosodwch y cynllun a&#39;r dyluniad ar yr <a href="%s">opsiynau talu</a> .','Enable guest checkout and/or review <a href="%s">customer accounts settings</a>.' => 'Galluogi talu fel gwestai a/neu adolygu <a href="%s">gosodiadau cyfrifon cwsmeriaid</a> .','Enable optimized <a href="%1$s">cart</a>, <a href="%2$s">thank you</a> and <a href="%3$s">order pay</a> pages.' => 'Galluogi <a href="%1$s">tudalennau</a> <a href="%3$s">talu archebion</a> , <a href="%2$s">diolch</a> a throsglwyddiadau wedi&#39;u optimeiddio.','Enable <a href="%s">address autocomplete</a> from Google Maps.' => 'Galluogi <a href="%s">cwblhau cyfeiriadau&#39;n awtomatig</a> o Google Maps.','Enable multiple saved addresses with <a href="%s">address book</a>.' => 'Galluogi nifer o gyfeiriadau wedi&#39;u cadw gyda <a href="%s">llyfr cyfeiriadau</a> .','Check if there are any <a href="%s">integration options</a> available for the theme or other plugins you have installed.' => 'Gwiriwch a oes unrhyw <a href="%s">opsiynau integreiddio</a> ar gael ar gyfer y thema neu ategion eraill rydych chi wedi&#39;u gosod.','Missing settings tab.' => 'Tab gosodiadau ar goll.','Getting started' => 'Dechrau arni','<strong>Great! Your checkout page is now running on Fluid Checkout.</strong> Here are a few steps to get started:' => '<strong>Gwych! Mae eich tudalen dalu bellach yn rhedeg ar Fluid Checkout.</strong> Dyma ychydig o gamau i ddechrau:','Completed' => 'Wedi&#39;i gwblhau','Send now' => 'Anfon nawr','Auto-detect' => 'Canfod yn awtomatig','Afrikaans' => 'Affricaneg','Albanian' => 'Albaneg','Amharic' => 'Amhareg','Arabic' => 'Arabeg','Armenian' => 'Armeneg','Azerbaijani' => 'Aserbaijaneg','Basque' => 'Basgeg','Belarusian' => 'Belarwseg','Bengali' => 'Bengaleg','Bosnian' => 'Bosneg','Bulgarian' => 'Bwlgareg','Burmese' => 'Byrmaneg','Catalan' => 'Catalaneg','Chinese' => 'Tsieineaidd','Chinese (Simplified)' => 'Tsieinëeg (Symledig)','Chinese (Hong Kong)' => 'Tsieineaidd (Hong Kong)','Chinese (Traditional)' => 'Tsieineaidd (Traddodiadol)','Croatian' => 'Croateg','Czech' => 'Tsieceg','Danish' => 'Daneg','Dutch' => 'Iseldireg','English' => 'Saesneg','English (Australian)' => 'Saesneg (Awstralia)','English (Great Britain)' => 'Saesneg (Prydain Fawr)','Estonian' => 'Estoneg','Farsi' => 'Farsi','Finnish' => 'Ffinneg','Filipino' => 'Ffilipinaidd','French' => 'Ffrangeg','French (Canadian)' => 'Ffrangeg (Canada)','Galician' => 'Galiseg','Georgian' => 'Georgegaidd','German' => 'Almaeneg','Greek' => 'Groeg','Gujarati' => 'Gwjarataidd','Hebrew' => 'Hebraeg','Hindi' => 'Hindi','Hungarian' => 'Hwngareg','Icelandic' => 'Islandeg','Indonesian' => 'Indoneseg','Italian' => 'Eidaleg','Japanese' => 'Japaneg','Kannada' => 'Kannada','Kazakh' => 'Casacheg','Khmer' => 'Khmer','Korean' => 'Coreeg','Kyrgyz' => 'Cirgiseg','Lao' => 'Laoaidd','Latvian' => 'Latfieg','Lithuanian' => 'Lithwaneg','Macedonian' => 'Macedoneg','Malay' => 'Malayeg','Malayalam' => 'Malayalam','Marathi' => 'Marathi','Mongolian' => 'Mongolaidd','Nepali' => 'Nepaleg','Norwegian' => 'Norwyeg','Polish' => 'Pwyleg','Portuguese' => 'Portiwgaleg','Portuguese (Brazil)' => 'Portiwgaleg (Brasil)','Portuguese (Portugal)' => 'Portiwgaleg (Portiwgal)','Punjabi' => 'Punjabi','Romanian' => 'Rwmaneg','Russian' => 'Rwsieg','Serbian' => 'Serbaidd','Sinhalese' => 'Sinhaleeg','Slovak' => 'Slofaceg','Slovenian' => 'Slofeneg','Spanish' => 'Sbaeneg','Spanish (Latin America)' => 'Sbaeneg (America Ladin)','Swahili' => 'Swahili','Swedish' => 'Swedeg','Tamil' => 'Tamil','Telugu' => 'Telugu','Thai' => 'Thai','Turkish' => 'Twrceg','Ukrainian' => 'Wcreineg','Urdu' => 'Wrdw','Vietnamese' => 'Fietnameg','Zulu' => 'Swlw','Google address autocomplete' => 'Cwblhau cyfeiriadau Google yn awtomatig','Google Places API version' => 'Fersiwn API Google Places','Choose which version of the Google Places API to use. We recommend moving to the new Places API as soon as possible.' => 'Dewiswch pa fersiwn o API Google Places i&#39;w defnyddio. Rydym yn argymell symud i&#39;r API Places newydd cyn gynted â phosibl.','We recommend using "Places API (New)" as effective March 1, 2025, Google will move the "Places API (Legacy)" version into Legacy status, meaning you will no longer be able to enable this service for new API keys and that that version of the API will eventually not be available anymore. Existing accounts already using the Legacy API may continue to work without disruptions.' => 'Rydym yn argymell defnyddio &quot;Places API (Newydd)&quot; gan y bydd Google, o Fawrth 1, 2025 ymlaen, yn symud y fersiwn &quot;Places API (Henfyd)&quot; i statws Henfyd, sy&#39;n golygu na fyddwch yn gallu galluogi&#39;r gwasanaeth hwn ar gyfer allweddi API newydd mwyach ac na fydd y fersiwn honno o&#39;r API ar gael mwyach yn y pen draw. Gall cyfrifon presennol sydd eisoes yn defnyddio&#39;r Hen API barhau i weithio heb unrhyw darfu.','(Recommended)' => '(Argymhellir)','Google API key' => 'Allwedd API Google','Paste your Google API key and use the test button to confirm it works for this website. Make sure the key is valid and allowed for your domain, otherwise the address field might get blocked preventing customers from completing their orders.' => 'Gludwch eich allwedd API Google a defnyddiwch y botwm prawf i gadarnhau ei bod yn gweithio ar gyfer y wefan hon. Gwnewch yn siŵr bod yr allwedd yn ddilys ac yn cael ei chaniatáu ar gyfer eich parth, fel arall gallai&#39;r maes cyfeiriad gael ei rwystro gan atal cwsmeriaid rhag cwblhau eu harchebion.','Enable Google address autocomplete' => 'Galluogi cwblhau cyfeiriadau Google yn awtomatig','Enable address autocompletion using the Google Maps APIs.' => 'Galluogi cwblhau cyfeiriadau&#39;n awtomatig gan ddefnyddio APIs Google Maps.','Google API language' => 'Iaith API Google','This language will be used to display the Google Places API address suggestions and addresses will also be autocompleted in this language.' => 'Bydd yr iaith hon yn cael ei defnyddio i arddangos awgrymiadau cyfeiriadau API Google Places a bydd cyfeiriadau hefyd yn cael eu cwblhau&#39;n awtomatig yn yr iaith hon.','Result types' => 'Mathau o ganlyniadau','Leave empty to accept any type of results, which usually yields better matching results. <a href="%s" target="_blank">See documentation for more details</a>. <br>Select up to 5 types of address search results to return on address autocomplete fields. <br>Visit the Google Maps documentation to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => 'Gadewch yn wag i dderbyn unrhyw fath o ganlyniadau, sydd fel arfer yn rhoi canlyniadau cyfatebol gwell. <a href="%s" target="_blank">Gweler y ddogfennaeth am fwy o fanylion</a> .<br> Dewiswch hyd at 5 math o ganlyniadau chwilio cyfeiriad i&#39;w dychwelyd ar feysydd cwblhau cyfeiriadau&#39;n awtomatig.<br> Ewch i ddogfennaeth Google Maps i ddysgu mwy am y <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">mathau a gefnogir</a> .','Result types (Legacy API)' => 'Mathau o ganlyniadau (API Hen)','Which type of address search results to return when using Places API (Legacy). <br>Visit the documentation of the Legacy Google Places API to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/supported_types#table3" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => 'Pa fath o ganlyniadau chwilio cyfeiriad i&#39;w dychwelyd wrth ddefnyddio API Places (Legacy).<br> Ewch i ddogfennaeth yr API Legacy Google Places i ddysgu mwy am y <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/supported_types#table3" target="_blank">mathau a gefnogir</a> .','Company fields' => 'Meysydd cwmni','Enable autocomplete for the company name if available' => 'Galluogi cwblhau awtomatig ar gyfer enw&#39;r cwmni os yw ar gael','Enable autocompletion of the company field with the company name information when returned from the Google Maps APIs.' => 'Galluogi cwblhau&#39;n awtomatig y maes cwmni gyda gwybodaeth enw&#39;r cwmni pan gaiff ei ddychwelyd o APIs Google Maps.','Business search' => 'Chwilio busnes','Enable search for businesses in the company field' => 'Galluogi chwilio am fusnesau yn y maes cwmni','Enable suggestion of addresses associated with a business when typing in the company field, then autocomplete all addresses fields when a business is selected from the suggestions.' => 'Galluogi awgrymu cyfeiriadau sy&#39;n gysylltiedig â busnes wrth deipio yn y maes cwmni, yna cwblhewch bob maes cyfeiriad yn awtomatig pan ddewisir busnes o&#39;r awgrymiadau.','Company result types' => 'Mathau o ganlyniadau cwmni','Select up to 5 types of address search results to return on autocomplete company fields. <br>Recommended value is <code>establishment</code>, which includes most types of businesses. <br>Leave empty to accept any type of results, including results that are not related to businesses. <br>Visit the Google Maps documentation to learn more about the <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">supported types</a>.' => 'Dewiswch hyd at 5 math o ganlyniadau chwilio cyfeiriad i&#39;w dychwelyd ar feysydd cwmni awto-gwblhau.<br> Y gwerth a argymhellir yw <code>establishment</code> , sy&#39;n cynnwys y rhan fwyaf o fathau o fusnesau.<br> Gadewch yn wag i dderbyn unrhyw fath o ganlyniadau, gan gynnwys canlyniadau nad ydynt yn gysylltiedig â busnesau.<br> Ewch i ddogfennaeth Google Maps i ddysgu mwy am y <a href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/place-types" target="_blank">mathau a gefnogir</a> .','Google logo' => 'Logo Google','Show text and logo "Powered by Google"' => 'Dangos testun a logo &quot;Wedi&#39;i bweru gan Google&quot;','When checked, the text and logo "Powered by Google" will be displayed at the bottom of the address autocomplete suggestions box.' => 'Pan gaiff ei dicio, bydd y testun a&#39;r logo &quot;Powered by Google&quot; yn cael eu harddangos ar waelod y blwch awgrymiadau awto-gwblhau cyfeiriadau.','Brasil API address autocomplete' => 'Cyfeiriad API Brasil yn awtomatig wedi&#39;i gwblhau','Brasil API' => 'API Brasil','Enable Brasil API address autocomplete for CEP fields' => 'Galluogi cwblhau cyfeiriadau API Brasil yn awtomatig ar gyfer meysydd CEP','Use Brasil API to retrieve and autofill addresses using the CEP/Postcode field. Only relevant for Brazilian addresses.' => 'Defnyddiwch API Brasil i adfer ac awto-lenwi cyfeiriadau gan ddefnyddio&#39;r maes CEP/Cod Post. Dim ond yn berthnasol i gyfeiriadau Brasil.','API version' => 'Fersiwn API','Choose which version of the Brasil API CEP method to use.' => 'Dewiswch pa fersiwn o ddull CEP API Brasil i&#39;w ddefnyddio.','Address book migration' => 'Mudo llyfr cyfeiriadau','WooCommerce addresses' => 'Cyfeiriadau WooCommerce','Copy existing shipping and billing addresses from WooCommerce into the customers\' address book.' => 'Copïwch gyfeiriadau cludo a bilio presennol o WooCommerce i lyfr cyfeiriadau cwsmeriaid.','Enable the address book feature' => 'Galluogi&#39;r nodwedd llyfr cyfeiriadau','Allow customers to save multiple addresses and define the default address to be used for shipping and billing.' => 'Caniatáu i gwsmeriaid gadw cyfeiriadau lluosog a diffinio&#39;r cyfeiriad diofyn i&#39;w ddefnyddio ar gyfer cludo a bilio.','Address labels' => 'Labeli cyfeiriad','Allow customers to add a custom label for each address' => 'Caniatáu i gwsmeriaid ychwanegu label personol ar gyfer pob cyfeiriad','Address labels make it easier to for customers to distinguish between their saved addresses (ie.: "Mom\'s House"). The address labels are private to the customers, and will not be displayed or printed on the order details page or invoices.' => 'Mae labeli cyfeiriad yn ei gwneud hi&#39;n haws i gwsmeriaid wahaniaethu rhwng eu cyfeiriadau wedi&#39;u cadw (h.y.: &quot;Tŷ Mam&quot;). Mae&#39;r labeli cyfeiriad yn breifat i&#39;r cwsmeriaid, ac ni fyddant yn cael eu harddangos na&#39;u hargraffu ar dudalen manylion yr archeb nac ar anfonebau.','Display layout' => 'Cynllun arddangos','Choose how saved addresses are displayed at checkout and on the cart.' => 'Dewiswch sut mae cyfeiriadau sydd wedi&#39;u cadw yn cael eu harddangos wrth y ddesg dalu ac ar y fasged.','Applies at checkout and on the cart. Saved addresses on the account page always use the cards layout.' => 'Yn berthnasol wrth y ddesg dalu ac ar y fasged. Mae cyfeiriadau sydd wedi&#39;u cadw ar dudalen y cyfrif bob amser yn defnyddio&#39;r cynllun cardiau.','Address cards' => 'Cardiau cyfeiriad','Address list' => 'rhestr gyfeiriadau','Dropdown field' => 'Maes ostwng','Address search' => 'Chwilio cyfeiriad','Show address search filter on frontend when customer has at least this number of saved addresses available.' => 'Dangos hidlydd chwilio cyfeiriadau ar y blaen pan fydd gan y cwsmer o leiaf y nifer hwn o gyfeiriadau wedi&#39;u cadw ar gael.','Not used when display layout is set to dropdown field.' => 'Ni ddefnyddir pan fydd cynllun yr arddangosfa wedi&#39;i osod i faes ostwng.','Addresses' => 'Cyfeiriadau','Enable cart page optimizations to see more options' => 'Galluogi optimeiddio tudalen y fasged i weld mwy o opsiynau','Sticky order summary' => 'Crynodeb archeb gludiog','Select position where to display the coupon codes section on the cart page. Only applicable when AJAX cart is enabled, and if use of coupon codes are enabled in the WooCommerce settings.' => 'Dewiswch y lleoliad lle i arddangos yr adran codau cwpon ar dudalen y fasged. Dim ond pan fydd basged AJAX wedi&#39;i galluogi, ac os yw defnyddio codau cwpon wedi&#39;u galluogi yn y gosodiadau WooCommerce y mae hyn yn berthnasol.','Layout of cross-sell' => 'Cynllun traws-werthu','Cross-sells displayed' => 'Croes-werthiannau a ddangosir','Items' => 'Eitemau','Cart page optimization' => 'Optimeiddio tudalen y fasged','Give your cart the same clear, conversion-focused layout as your checkout.' => 'Rhowch yr un cynllun clir, sy&#39;n canolbwyntio ar drawsnewidiadau, i&#39;ch trol â&#39;ch proses dalu.','Match the cart layout to the checkout page for a consistent purchase journey.' => 'Cydweddwch gynllun y fasged â&#39;r dudalen dalu am daith brynu gyson.','Keep the cart always updated in the background, no full page reloads when quantities change.' => 'Cadwch y fasged yn gyfredol yn y cefndir bob amser, dim ail-lwytho tudalen lawn pan fydd meintiau&#39;n newid.','Place coupon codes, shipping, and cross-sells exactly where they convert best.' => 'Rhowch godau cwpon, cludo, a chroes-werthiannau yn union lle maen nhw&#39;n trosi orau.','Keep the order summary visible while scrolling, and add trust symbols where shoppers need reassurance.' => 'Cadwch grynodeb yr archeb yn weladwy wrth sgrolio, ac ychwanegwch symbolau ymddiriedaeth lle mae angen sicrwydd ar siopwyr.','Columns' => 'Colofnau','When using the <em>"1 column"</em> layout with the <em>"Split"</em> design template, a right column is shown only if the page sidebar widget area is active (Checkout Sidebar, Cart Sidebar, or Order Received Sidebar). Otherwise the page stays as a single column with Split styles.' => 'Wrth ddefnyddio&#39;r cynllun <em>&quot;1 golofn&quot;</em> gyda&#39;r templed dylunio <em>&quot;Rhannu&quot;</em> , dim ond os yw ardal teclyn bar ochr y dudalen yn weithredol y dangosir colofn dde (Bar Ochr Talu, Bar Ochr y Fasged, neu Far Ochr Gorchymyn a Dderbyniwyd). Fel arall, mae&#39;r dudalen yn aros fel un golofn gydag arddulliau Rhannu.','Split column background' => 'Cefndir colofn hollt','Choose a background color for the Split design secondary column. Leave empty to use the order summary background color.' => 'Dewiswch liw cefndir ar gyfer y golofn eilaidd Dyluniad hollti. Gadewch yn wag i ddefnyddio lliw cefndir crynodeb yr archeb.','Page templates' => 'Templedi tudalennau','Checkout template' => 'Templed talu','Recommended for fewer distractions at checkout. <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/cart-abandonment" target="_blank">Read the research about cart abandonment</a>.' => 'Argymhellir ar gyfer llai o wrthdyniadau wrth y ddesg dalu. <a href="https://baymard.com/blog/cart-abandonment" target="_blank">Darllenwch yr ymchwil am adael basged</a> .','Sticky progress bar' => 'Bar cynnydd gludiog','Progress bar style' => 'Arddull bar cynnydd','Order totals' => 'Cyfansymiau archebion','Background color' => 'Lliw cefndir','Action link' => 'Dolen gweithredu','Mobile order summary' => 'Crynodeb archeb symudol','Mobile initial state' => 'Cyflwr cychwynnol symudol','Enable editing cart items at checkout' => 'Galluogi golygu eitemau basged wrth y ddesg dalu','Allow customers to change product quantities or remove items directly at the checkout page.' => 'Caniatáu i gwsmeriaid newid meintiau cynnyrch neu ddileu eitemau yn uniongyrchol ar y dudalen dalu.','Cart item errors' => 'Gwallau eitem basged','Only applicable when coupon code is displayed as a separate section on the checkout or cart pages, and if use of coupon codes are enabled in the WooCommerce settings.' => 'Dim ond yn berthnasol pan fydd cod cwpon yn cael ei arddangos fel adran ar wahân ar dudalennau&#39;r ddesg dalu neu&#39;r fasged, ac os yw defnyddio codau cwpon wedi&#39;u galluogi yn y gosodiadau WooCommerce.','Coupon codes position' => 'Safle codau cwpon','Apply coupon button' => 'Botwm defnyddio cwpon','Select style of the "apply coupon" button.' => 'Dewiswch arddull y botwm &quot;gwneud cais am gwpon&quot;.','Address line 2' => 'Llinell gyfeiriad 2','This setting is shared between the Checkout and Local pickup sections. On the Local pickup section, it also decides whether the Ship/Pickup selector shows inside the shipping method section (before the address) or as a separate section (after).' => 'Mae&#39;r gosodiad hwn yn cael ei rannu rhwng yr adrannau Talu a Chasglu Lleol. Yn yr adran Casglu Lleol, mae hefyd yn penderfynu a yw&#39;r dewiswr Llongau/Casglu yn ymddangos y tu mewn i&#39;r adran dull cludo (cyn y cyfeiriad) neu fel adran ar wahân (ar ôl).','Customer accounts' => 'Cyfrifon cwsmeriaid','Guest checkout' => 'Ymadawiad gwestai','Guest checkout, login, and account creation options from the WooCommerce Accounts settings page. They are managed here for your convenience, and so you can use different values per settings profile.' => 'Dewisiadau gwirio allan, mewngofnodi, a chreu cyfrif gan westeion o dudalen gosodiadau Cyfrifon WooCommerce. Fe&#39;u rheolir yma er hwylustod i chi, ac felly gallwch ddefnyddio gwahanol werthoedd fesul proffil gosodiadau.','Allow customers to checkout without an account' => 'Caniatáu i gwsmeriaid dalu heb gyfrif','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to create an account or log in during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>Argymhellir</strong> fel nad gofynnir i gwsmeriaid greu cyfrif na mewngofnodi yn ystod y ddesg dalu, a all ostwng cyfraddau trosi.','When disabled, customers must log in or create an account to complete the purchase.' => 'Pan fydd wedi&#39;i analluogi, rhaid i gwsmeriaid fewngofnodi neu greu cyfrif i gwblhau&#39;r pryniant.','Login at checkout' => 'Mewngofnodi wrth y ddesg dalu','Enable log-in during checkout' => 'Galluogi mewngofnodi yn ystod y ddesg dalu','Show a link for returning customers to log in from the checkout page.' => 'Dangoswch ddolen i gwsmeriaid sy&#39;n dychwelyd fewngofnodi o&#39;r dudalen talu.','Account creation' => 'Creu cyfrif','Allow customers to create an account during checkout' => 'Caniatáu i gwsmeriaid greu cyfrif yn ystod y ddesg dalu','Allow customers to create an account from the My account page' => 'Caniatáu i gwsmeriaid greu cyfrif o&#39;r dudalen Fy nghyfrif','Customers can register a new account from the My account page.' => 'Gall cwsmeriaid gofrestru cyfrif newydd o dudalen Fy nghyfrif.','Username' => 'Enw defnyddiwr','Generate from customer\'s name' => 'Cynhyrchu o enw&#39;r cwsmer','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to choose a username during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>Argymhellir</strong> fel nad gofynnir i gwsmeriaid ddewis enw defnyddiwr wrth dalu, a all ostwng cyfraddau trosi.','A username is generated from the customer name, or from the email address when a name cannot be used.' => 'Cynhyrchir enw defnyddiwr o enw&#39;r cwsmer, neu o&#39;r cyfeiriad e-bost pan na ellir defnyddio enw.','Password' => 'Cyfrinair','Send password setup link' => 'Anfon dolen sefydlu cyfrinair','<strong>Recommended</strong> so customers are not asked to set a password during checkout, which can lower conversion rates.' => '<strong>Argymhellir</strong> fel nad gofynnir i gwsmeriaid osod cyfrinair wrth dalu, a all ostwng cyfraddau trosi.','Customers receive an email to create their password securely.' => 'Mae cwsmeriaid yn derbyn e-bost i greu eu cyfrinair yn ddiogel.','Let registered customers complete checkout without logging in and associate the order with their existing account when contact details match.' => 'Gadewch i gwsmeriaid cofrestredig gwblhau&#39;r broses dalu heb fewngofnodi a chysylltu&#39;r archeb â&#39;u cyfrif presennol pan fydd y manylion cyswllt yn cyfateb.','Existing account message' => 'Neges cyfrif presennol','Let customers create an account after placing their order, from the thank you page.' => 'Gadewch i gwsmeriaid greu cyfrif ar ôl gosod eu harcheb, o&#39;r dudalen diolch.','Options in this section are available when guest checkout and account matching are enabled. Enable both features above to configure delayed account creation.' => 'Mae opsiynau yn yr adran hon ar gael pan fydd gadael gwesteion a chyfatebu cyfrifon wedi&#39;u galluogi. Galluogwch y ddau nodwedd uchod i ffurfweddu creu cyfrif wedi&#39;i ohirio.','Enable delayed account creation' => 'Galluogi creu cyfrif wedi&#39;i ohirio','Enable delayed account creation when both guest checkout and account matching are enabled.' => 'Galluogi creu cyfrif wedi&#39;i ohirio pan fydd y ddau ddull wedi&#39;u galluogi wrth dalu wrth gefn gan westeion a pharu cyfrifon.','Section position' => 'Safle&#39;r adran','Before customer details section' => 'Cyn yr adran manylion cwsmeriaid','After customer details section' => 'Ar ôl yr adran manylion cwsmeriaid','Account creation benefits' => 'Manteision creu cyfrif','Leaving the field empty will display the default text.' => 'Bydd gadael y maes yn wag yn dangos y testun diofyn.','Inline buttons' => 'Botymau mewnol','Required fields' => 'Meysydd gofynnol','Enable gift message fields at checkout' => 'Galluogi meysydd neges rhodd wrth y ddesg dalu','Expanded gift message' => 'Neges rhodd estynedig','Display gift message field always expanded' => 'Dangos maes neges anrheg wedi&#39;i ehangu bob amser','Gift message in order details' => 'Neges rhodd ym manylion yr archeb','No integrations available at the moment on this section. The options related to each plugin and theme will only appear here when that plugin or theme is activated.' => 'Nid oes unrhyw integreiddiadau ar gael ar hyn o bryd yn yr adran hon. Dim ond pan fydd yr ategyn neu&#39;r thema honno wedi&#39;i actifadu y bydd yr opsiynau sy&#39;n gysylltiedig â phob ategyn a thema yn ymddangos yma.','Phone fields' => 'Meysydd ffôn','Field visibility' => 'Gwelededd maes','Field position' => 'Safle maes','Phone country code & validation' => 'Cod gwlad ffôn a dilysu','Country' => 'Gwlad','Enable country on phone fields' => 'Galluogi gwlad ar feysydd ffôn','Filter countries for shipping or billing' => 'Hidlo gwledydd ar gyfer cludo neu bilio','Limit the country selector on each phone field to the countries allowed for shipping or billing on your store.' => 'Cyfyngwch y dewiswr gwlad ar bob maes ffôn i&#39;r gwledydd a ganiateir ar gyfer cludo neu bilio yn eich siop.','Validation' => 'Dilysu','Enable simple validation based on country rules' => 'Galluogi dilysu syml yn seiliedig ar reolau gwlad','Checks that the phone number is valid for the selected country, including country code and length.' => 'Yn gwirio bod y rhif ffôn yn ddilys ar gyfer y wlad a ddewiswyd, gan gynnwys cod y wlad a&#39;r hyd.','Stricter check that the number is a valid mobile, fixed line, or other accepted type for the selected country. May reject some valid numbers.' => 'Gwiriad mwy llym bod y rhif yn rhif ffôn symudol, llinell sefydlog, neu fath arall a dderbynnir yn ddilys ar gyfer y wlad a ddewiswyd. Gall wrthod rhai rhifau dilys.','Validation types' => 'Mathau dilysu','Placeholders' => 'Dalwyr lleoedd','No license keys to manage at the moment. License keys will appear here when a licensed Fluid Checkout plugin or add-on is active.' => 'Dim allweddi trwydded i&#39;w rheoli ar hyn o bryd. Bydd allweddi trwydded yn ymddangos yma pan fydd ategyn neu ychwanegiad trwyddedig Fluid Checkout yn weithredol.','Default delivery type' => 'Math dosbarthu diofyn','Choose which delivery type will be selected by default.' => 'Dewiswch pa fath o ddosbarthu fydd yn cael ei ddewis yn ddiofyn.','Shipping zone fields' => 'Meysydd parth cludo','Choose which fields will be displayed for the local pickup shipping zone filter fields. Leave empty to show all available options.' => 'Dewiswch pa feysydd fydd yn cael eu harddangos ar gyfer y meysydd hidlo parth cludo casglu lleol. Gadewch yn wag i ddangos yr holl opsiynau sydd ar gael.','These fields will be displayed as a filter for the local pickup shipping methods. Some fields might still appear at checkout when not selected here, if compatible plugins require them to work properly.' => 'Bydd y meysydd hyn yn cael eu harddangos fel hidlydd ar gyfer y dulliau cludo casglu lleol. Efallai y bydd rhai meysydd yn dal i ymddangos wrth y ddesg dalu pan nad ydynt wedi&#39;u dewis yma, os yw ategion cydnaws yn gofyn iddynt weithio&#39;n iawn.','Order shipping address' => 'Cyfeiriad cludo&#39;r archeb','Order pay page optimization' => 'Optimeiddio tudalen talu archebion','Give unpaid orders the same clear, conversion-focused layout as checkout.' => 'Rhowch yr un cynllun clir, sy&#39;n canolbwyntio ar drawsnewidiadau, i archebion heb eu talu â&#39;r ddesg dalu.','Optimize the layout of the order pay page for orders pending payment.' => 'Optimeiddiwch gynllun y dudalen talu archebion ar gyfer archebion sy&#39;n aros am daliad.','Match the order pay experience to your checkout for a consistent purchase journey.' => 'Cydweddwch y profiad talu archeb â&#39;ch proses dalu er mwyn sicrhau taith brynu gyson.','Add trust symbols and badges where shoppers need reassurance before paying.' => 'Ychwanegwch symbolau a bathodynnau ymddiriedaeth lle mae angen sicrwydd ar siopwyr cyn talu.','Thank you page optimization' => 'Diolch am optimeiddio tudalen','Make the thank you page and order details clearer for customers after they buy.' => 'Gwnewch y dudalen ddiolch a manylion yr archeb yn gliriach i gwsmeriaid ar ôl iddynt brynu.','Optimize the thank you page and account order details with a clearer layout.' => 'Optimeiddiwch y dudalen ddiolch a manylion archeb y cyfrif gyda chynllun cliriach.','Show order status progress, actions, downloads, and notes where they make sense.' => 'Dangoswch gynnydd statws archeb, camau gweithredu, lawrlwythiadau a nodiadau lle maen nhw&#39;n gwneud synnwyr.','Customize order details sections on email notifications.' => 'Addasu adrannau manylion archeb ar hysbysiadau e-bost.','Add trust symbols and badges where shoppers need reassurance after purchase.' => 'Ychwanegwch symbolau a bathodynnau ymddiriedaeth lle mae angen sicrwydd ar siopwyr ar ôl prynu.','Email notifications' => 'Hysbysiadau e-bost','Enable thank you page and order details optimizations to see more options' => 'Galluogi optimeiddio tudalen diolch a manylion archeb i weld mwy o opsiynau','Use wide layout on thank you page' => 'Defnyddiwch gynllun llydan ar dudalen diolch','These options affect the thank you page, view order details on account pages and on email notifications.' => 'Mae&#39;r opsiynau hyn yn effeithio ar y dudalen diolch, gweld manylion archeb ar dudalennau cyfrif ac ar hysbysiadau e-bost.','Save settings' => 'Cadw gosodiadau','Docs' => 'Dogfennau','Cart' => 'Basged','Thank you' => 'Diolch yn fawr','Address autocomplete' => 'Cwblhau cyfeiriad yn awtomatig','Trust badges' => 'Bathodynnau ymddiriedaeth','You do not have permission to save these settings.' => 'Nid oes gennych ganiatâd i gadw&#39;r gosodiadau hyn.','Invalid save request.' => 'Cais arbed annilys.','Your settings have been saved.' => 'Mae eich gosodiadau wedi cael eu cadw.','Saving...' => 'Yn cadw...','Settings could not be saved. Please try again.' => 'Ni ellid cadw&#39;r gosodiadau. Rhowch gynnig arall arni.','Dismiss notice' => 'Diystyru hysbysiad','Open settings menu' => 'Agor y ddewislen gosodiadau','Close settings menu' => 'Cau&#39;r ddewislen gosodiadau','Preview' => 'Rhagolwg','Expand preview' => 'Ehangu&#39;r rhagolwg','Collapse preview' => 'Cwympo rhagolwg','Show header and footer' => 'Dangos pennawd a throedyn','Hide header and footer' => 'Cuddio&#39;r pennawd a&#39;r troedyn','Page preview' => 'Rhagolwg tudalen','Preview viewport' => 'Rhagolwg o&#39;r porth gwylio','Tablet' => 'Tabled','Desktop' => 'Penbwrdd','Preview width' => 'Lled rhagolwg','Decrease width' => 'Lleihau&#39;r lled','Preview width in pixels' => 'Lled rhagolwg mewn picseli','Increase width' => 'Cynyddu lled','Preview as' => 'Rhagolwg fel','Guest' => 'Gwestai','Logged in' => 'Wedi mewngofnodi','Preview page' => 'Tudalen rhagolwg','Expand preview for a closer look' => 'Ehangu&#39;r rhagolwg i gael golwg agosach','Available with %s.' => 'Ar gael gyda %s.','Turn them on' => 'Trowch nhw ymlaen','Optimizations for this page are turned off. %s to preview the page.' => 'Mae optimeiddio ar gyfer y dudalen hon wedi&#39;i ddiffodd. %s i weld rhagolwg o&#39;r dudalen.','%s preview' => 'rhagolwg %s','Isolated session · nothing is saved' => 'Sesiwn ynysig · does dim byd wedi&#39;i gadw','Usage tracking' => 'Olrhain defnydd','Plugin settings' => 'Gosodiadau ategyn','Coming soon' => 'Yn dod yn fuan','Utilities' => 'Cyfleustodau','Use <code>TomSelect</code> dropdown components instead of <code>select2</code>' => 'Defnyddiwch gydrannau rhestr ostwng <code>TomSelect</code> yn lle <code>select2</code>','TomSelect is a simpler dropdown selection component which is less prone to errors than Select2, while offering the same functionality.' => 'Mae TomSelect yn gydran dewis ostwng symlach sy&#39;n llai tebygol o gael gwallau na Select2, tra&#39;n cynnig yr un swyddogaeth.','Sets the font size inside form fields to 16px on pages optimized by this plugin to avoid automatically zooming in when interacting with form fields on small devices.' => 'Yn gosod maint y ffont y tu mewn i feysydd ffurflen i 16px ar dudalennau sydd wedi&#39;u optimeiddio gan yr ategyn hwn i osgoi chwyddo i mewn yn awtomatig wrth ryngweithio â meysydd ffurflen ar ddyfeisiau bach.','Safari and other browsers might automatically zoom in on mobile devices to make the text easier to read when the font size is smaller than 16px.' => 'Efallai y bydd Safari a phorwyr eraill yn chwyddo i mewn yn awtomatig ar ddyfeisiau symudol i wneud y testun yn haws i&#39;w ddarllen pan fydd maint y ffont yn llai na 16px.','Enable script processing tracking on the browser console.' => 'Galluogi olrhain prosesu sgriptiau ar gonsol y porwr.','Unminified assets' => 'Asedau heb eu lleihau','Google Maps scripts' => 'Sgriptiau Google Maps','Do not remove duplicate Google Maps scripts' => 'Peidiwch â thynnu sgriptiau Google Maps dyblyg','When enabled, duplicate Google Maps scripts will NOT be removed which can cause errors and performance issues. Only use this option while troubleshooting.' => 'Pan gaiff ei alluogi, NI fydd sgriptiau dyblyg Google Maps yn cael eu tynnu a all achosi gwallau a phroblemau perfformiad. Defnyddiwch yr opsiwn hwn wrth ddatrys problemau yn unig.','Widget areas' => 'Ardaloedd teclyn','Last step on mobile' => 'Cam olaf ar ffôn symudol','Display widgets only at last step on mobile' => 'Dangos teclynnau yn y cam olaf yn unig ar ffôn symudol','Display checkout trust badge widgets only when viewing the last checkout step on mobile devices' => 'Dangos teclynnau bathodyn ymddiriedaeth y ddesg dalu dim ond wrth edrych ar y cam talu olaf ar ddyfeisiau symudol','Standard' => 'Safonol','VAT number field' => 'maes rhif TAW','Add a VAT number field to the billing form.' => 'Ychwanegwch faes rhif TAW at y ffurflen bilio.','Field label' => 'Label maes','Set the label of the VAT number field (ie. VAT number). On multi-language websites, it is better to leave this field empty and translate the original string.' => 'Gosodwch label y maes rhif TAW (h.y. rhif TAW). Ar wefannau amlieithog, mae&#39;n well gadael y maes hwn yn wag a chyfieithu&#39;r llinyn gwreiddiol.','VAT Number' => 'Rhif TAW','EU-VAT' => 'TAW yr UE','Enable the VAT number field to see more options' => 'Galluogwch y maes rhif TAW i weld mwy o opsiynau','VAT validation' => 'Dilysu TAW','Validate VAT number field for EU-VAT during checkout' => 'Dilysu maes rhif TAW ar gyfer TAW yr UE yn ystod y ddesg dalu','Checks if the VAT Number provided is a valid VAT number registered on the European VIES Database (VAT Information Exchange System).' => 'Yn gwirio a yw&#39;r Rhif TAW a ddarperir yn rhif TAW dilys sydd wedi&#39;i gofrestru ar Gronfa Ddata VIES Ewropeaidd (System Cyfnewid Gwybodaeth TAW).','Shop VAT number' => 'Rhif TAW y siop','The shop\'s VAT number used for requesting EU-VAT validation, and printed on invoices. <br><strong>We strongly recommend adding your Shop VAT number</strong> as otherwise the VIES consultation results might not be valid for accounting purposes. <br>Ie.: <code>ATU99999999</code> or <code>EE999999999</code>.' => 'Rhif TAW y siop a ddefnyddir ar gyfer gofyn am ddilysiad TAW yr UE, ac a argraffwyd ar anfonebau.<br> <strong>Rydym yn argymell yn gryf ychwanegu rhif TAW eich Siop</strong> oherwydd fel arall efallai na fydd canlyniadau ymgynghoriad VIES yn ddilys at ddibenion cyfrifyddu.<br> Hy.: <code>ATU99999999</code> neu <code>EE999999999</code> .','Reverse charge' => 'Tâl gwrthdro','Apply reverse charge mechanism' => 'Cymhwyso mecanwaith codi tâl gwrthdro','Set tax rate to zero and display "Reverse charge" on invoices when the customer\'s VAT number is valid. A different "Reverse charge" text might be required depending on the store\'s country.' => 'Gosodwch y gyfradd dreth i sero ac arddangoswch &quot;Tâl gwrthdro&quot; ar anfonebau pan fydd rhif TAW y cwsmer yn ddilys. Efallai y bydd angen testun &quot;Tâl gwrthdro&quot; gwahanol yn dibynnu ar wlad y siop.','Same country' => 'Yr un wlad','Apply reverse charge mechanism for transactions in the shop country:' => 'Cymhwyso mecanwaith tâl gwrthdro ar gyfer trafodion yng ngwlad y siop:','Enables applying reverse charge mechanism for transactions between companies in the same country as the shop.' => 'Yn galluogi cymhwyso mecanwaith tâl gwrthdro ar gyfer trafodion rhwng cwmnïau yn yr un wlad â&#39;r siop.','Reverse charge exceptions' => 'Eithriadau tâl gwrthdro','Select additional countries to skip applying the reverse charge mechanism.' => 'Dewiswch wledydd ychwanegol i hepgor cymhwyso&#39;r mecanwaith tâl gwrthdro.','Taxes will be charged to orders from these countries even when a valid VAT number is provided.' => 'Codir trethi ar archebion o&#39;r gwledydd hyn hyd yn oed pan ddarperir rhif TAW dilys.','Reverse charge label on invoices' => 'Label tâl gwrthdro ar anfonebau','Set the label of "reverse charge" on the checkout page and order details.' => 'Gosodwch y label &quot;tâl gwrthdro&quot; ar y dudalen dalu a manylion yr archeb.','Reverse charge text on invoices' => 'Testun tâl gwrthdro ar anfonebau','Set the label of "reverse charge" text on invoices.' => 'Gosodwch y label testun &quot;tâl gwrthdro&quot; ar anfonebau.','Tax to be paid on reverse charge basis' => 'Treth i&#39;w thalu ar sail tâl gwrthdro','Company name' => 'Enw&#39;r cwmni','Autocomplete company name from VAT number' => 'Cwblhau enw&#39;r cwmni&#39;n awtomatig o rif TAW','Fill in the billing company name based on the valid VAT number provided by the customer.' => 'Llenwch enw&#39;r cwmni bilio yn seiliedig ar y rhif TAW dilys a ddarparwyd gan y cwsmer.','Company name editing' => 'Golygu enw&#39;r cwmni','Allow editing of auto-filled company name' => 'Caniatáu golygu enw cwmni sydd wedi&#39;i lenwi&#39;n awtomatig','When enabled, customers can change the company name associated with the provided VAT number.' => 'Pan fydd wedi&#39;i alluogi, gall cwsmeriaid newid enw&#39;r cwmni sy&#39;n gysylltiedig â&#39;r rhif TAW a ddarperir.','EU-VAT for digital goods' => 'TAW yr UE ar gyfer nwyddau digidol','From January 1st, 2015, modifications have been made to the EU VAT regulations concerning digital goods, impacting exclusively B2C transactions. The VAT on digital goods must be calculated based on the customer\'s location, and evidence of this needs to be collected (IP address and billing address).' => 'O 1 Ionawr 2015 ymlaen, gwnaed addasiadau i reoliadau TAW yr UE ynghylch nwyddau digidol, gan effeithio ar drafodion B2C yn unig. Rhaid cyfrifo&#39;r TAW ar nwyddau digidol yn seiliedig ar leoliad y cwsmer, ac mae angen casglu tystiolaeth o hyn (cyfeiriad IP a chyfeiriad bilio).','Tax classes for digital goods' => 'Dosbarthiadau treth ar gyfer nwyddau digidol','Select some tax classes' => 'Dewiswch rai dosbarthiadau treth','Location evidence' => 'Tystiolaeth lleoliad','Collect customer\'s location evidence' => 'Casglu tystiolaeth o leoliad y cwsmer','Saves the IP address and validate it against the customer\'s billing address. Customer\'s must confirm their billing address by checking a checkbox on the checkout page if the country from their billing address and IP do not match.' => 'Yn cadw&#39;r cyfeiriad IP ac yn ei ddilysu yn erbyn cyfeiriad bilio&#39;r cwsmer. Rhaid i gwsmeriaid gadarnhau eu cyfeiriad bilio drwy dicio blwch ticio ar y dudalen dalu os nad yw&#39;r wlad o&#39;u cyfeiriad bilio a&#39;u cyfeiriad IP yn cyfateb.','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. <a href="%s">Change it in Customer accounts settings</a>.' => 'Rheolir yr opsiwn hwn yn Fluid Checkout. <a href="%s">Newidiwch ef yng ngosodiadau cyfrifon Cwsmeriaid</a> .','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. Change it under Fluid Checkout > Customer accounts.' => 'Rheolir yr opsiwn hwn yn Fluid Checkout. Newidiwch ef o dan Fluid Checkout &gt; Cyfrifon cwsmeriaid.','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. The shipping destination is always set to "Default to customer shipping address" when Fluid Checkout is activated. Customers can still provide different shipping and billing addresses during checkout.<br><br>An option for setting the default billing address to be the same as the shipping address is available in the <a href="%s">Fluid Checkout settings</a>.' => 'Rheolir yr opsiwn hwn yn Fluid Checkout. Mae&#39;r gyrchfan cludo bob amser wedi&#39;i gosod i &quot;Y cyfeiriad cludo cwsmer yn ddiofyn&quot; pan fydd Fluid Checkout wedi&#39;i actifadu. Gall cwsmeriaid barhau i ddarparu cyfeiriadau cludo a bilio gwahanol yn ystod y ddesg dalu.<br><br> Mae opsiwn ar gael yn y <a href="%s">gosodiadau Fluid Checkout</a> i osod y cyfeiriad bilio diofyn i fod yr un fath â&#39;r cyfeiriad cludo.','This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. The shipping destination is always set to "Default to customer shipping address" when Fluid Checkout is activated. Customers can still provide different shipping and billing addresses during checkout.<br><br>An option for setting the default billing address to be the same as the shipping address is available at WooCommerce > Settings > Fluid Checkout.' => 'Rheolir yr opsiwn hwn yn Fluid Checkout. Mae&#39;r gyrchfan cludo bob amser wedi&#39;i gosod i &quot;Y cyfeiriad cludo cwsmer yn ddiofyn&quot; pan fydd Fluid Checkout wedi&#39;i actifadu. Gall cwsmeriaid barhau i ddarparu cyfeiriadau cludo a bilio gwahanol yn ystod y ddesg dalu.<br><br> Mae opsiwn ar gyfer gosod y cyfeiriad bilio diofyn i fod yr un fath â&#39;r cyfeiriad cludo ar gael yn WooCommerce &gt; Gosodiadau &gt; Fluid Checkout.','These settings have been moved to WP Admin > Fluid Checkout > Settings.' => 'Mae&#39;r gosodiadau hyn wedi cael eu symud i WP Admin &gt; Fluid Checkout &gt; Gosodiadau.','This WooCommerce Settings tab is deprecated and will be removed in Fluid Checkout 6.0.' => 'Mae&#39;r tab Gosodiadau WooCommerce hwn wedi&#39;i ddirymu a bydd yn cael ei ddileu yn Fluid Checkout 6.0.','Go to settings page' => 'Ewch i&#39;r dudalen gosodiadau','Hide this tab permanently' => 'Cuddio&#39;r tab hwn yn barhaol','Close' => 'Cau','PRO feature' => 'Nodwedd PRO','Other plugins' => 'Ategynnau eraill','Install add-on' => 'Gosod ychwanegiad','<a target="_blank" href="%1$s">Get %2$s</a> to unlock these options.' => '<a target="_blank" href="%1$s">Cael %2$s</a> i ddatgloi&#39;r opsiynau hyn.','Add-on' => 'Ychwanegiad','View documentation' => 'Gweld dogfennaeth','Requests require a logged-in WordPress user. Omit user_id to use the current user\'s data, or pass user_id to target another account when the caller can edit that user (edit_user capability). Unauthenticated requests return fc_api_forbidden. An invalid user_id returns fc_api_user_not_found.' => 'Mae angen defnyddiwr WordPress sydd wedi mewngofnodi ar gyfer ceisiadau. Hepgorwch user_id i ddefnyddio data&#39;r defnyddiwr cyfredol, neu pasiwch user_id i dargedu cyfrif arall pan all y galwr olygu&#39;r defnyddiwr hwnnw (gallu edit_user). Mae ceisiadau heb eu dilysu yn dychwelyd fc_api_forbidden. Mae user_id annilys yn dychwelyd fc_api_user_not_found.','HTTP 200 with { "data": { ... } } when the handler returns a payload.' => 'HTTP 200 gyda { &quot;data&quot;: { ... } } pan fydd y trinwr yn dychwelyd llwyth tâl.','HTTP 200 with { "success": true } when there is no payload (for example DELETE).' => 'HTTP 200 gyda { &quot;success&quot;: true } pan nad oes llwyth tâl (er enghraifft DELETE).','Failures return WordPress REST error JSON from WP_Error (code, message, data.status). Wire codes use the fc_api_* prefix.' => 'Mae methiannau&#39;n dychwelyd gwall REST WordPress JSON o WP_Error (cod, neges, data.status). Mae codau gwifren yn defnyddio&#39;r rhagddodiad fc_api_*.','Forbidden access.' => 'Mynediad gwaharddedig.','Target user was not found.' => 'Ni chanfuwyd y defnyddiwr targed.','This feature is not available.' => 'Nid yw&#39;r nodwedd hon ar gael.','A required address field is missing.' => 'Mae maes cyfeiriad gofynnol ar goll.','Postcode or ZIP is invalid.' => 'Mae&#39;r cod post neu&#39;r cod ZIP yn annilys.','Phone number is invalid.' => 'Mae&#39;r rhif ffôn yn annilys.','State or county is invalid.' => 'Mae&#39;r dalaith neu&#39;r sir yn annilys.','Country is invalid or has no address fields.' => 'Mae&#39;r wlad yn annilys neu nid oes ganddi feysydd cyfeiriad.','The request could not be processed.' => 'Ni ellid prosesu&#39;r cais.','Back to previous step' => 'Yn ôl i&#39;r cam blaenorol','Skip to settings' => 'Neidio i&#39;r gosodiadau','Start over and return to the first guided setup step' => 'Dechreuwch o’r newydd a dychwelwch i’r cam gosod cyntaf dan arweiniad','Start over' => 'Dechrau o’r newydd','Please complete all sub-steps before continuing.' => 'Cwblhewch yr holl is-gamau cyn parhau.','Expand' => 'Ehangu','Collapse' => 'Cwymp','Skip' => 'Hepgor','Mark as complete' => 'Marcio fel wedi&#39;i gwblhau','Mark as incomplete' => 'Marcio fel anghyflawn','View full-size image: %s' => 'Gweld delwedd maint llawn: %s','Full-size setup guide image' => 'Delwedd canllaw gosod maint llawn','Close image' => 'Cau&#39;r ddelwedd','Fluid Checkout Guided Setup' => 'Gosodiad Arweiniedig ar gyfer Talu Hylif','All set' => 'Yn barod','You do not have permission to access this page.' => 'Nid oes gennych ganiatâd i gael mynediad i&#39;r dudalen hon.','Go to step %1$d: %2$s' => 'Ewch i gam %1$d: %2$s','Finish & go to settings' => 'Gorffen ac ewch i osodiadau','Update the billing phone field visibility option from the legacy value to match WooCommerce conventions.' => 'Diweddarwch yr opsiwn gwelededd maes ffôn bilio o&#39;r gwerth etifeddol i gyd-fynd â chonfensiynau WooCommerce.','Update the shipping phone field visibility option from the legacy value to match WooCommerce conventions.' => 'Diweddarwch yr opsiwn gwelededd maes ffôn cludo o&#39;r gwerth etifeddol i gyd-fynd â chonfensiynau WooCommerce.','Copy the order summary background color setting to the new Split design secondary column background color option.' => 'Copïwch osodiad lliw cefndir crynodeb yr archeb i&#39;r opsiwn lliw cefndir colofn eilaidd newydd ar gyfer y dyluniad Hollti.','The enhanced select fields feature is always disabled when using the Biteship plugin.' => 'Mae&#39;r nodwedd dewis meysydd gwell bob amser wedi&#39;i hanalluogi wrth ddefnyddio&#39;r ategyn Biteship.','The place order position is always set to "Below the order summary" when using German Market. That plugin requires the place order button and legal checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary.' => 'Mae safle gosod yr archeb bob amser wedi&#39;i osod i &quot;Islaw crynodeb yr archeb&quot; wrth ddefnyddio&#39;r Farchnad Almaenig. Mae&#39;r ategyn hwnnw&#39;n gofyn am arddangos y botwm gosod archeb a&#39;r blychau gwirio cyfreithiol o dan grynodeb yr archeb.','The place order position is always set to "Below the order summary" when using Germanized for WooCommerce. That plugin requires the place order button and legal checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary.' => 'Mae safle&#39;r archeb bob amser wedi&#39;i osod i &quot;Islaw crynodeb yr archeb&quot; wrth ddefnyddio Almaeneg ar gyfer WooCommerce. Mae&#39;r ategyn hwnnw&#39;n gofyn am arddangos y botwm archeb a&#39;r blychau gwirio cyfreithiol o dan grynodeb yr archeb.','Edit pickup locations' => 'Golygu lleoliadau casglu','Use local pickup label from WooCommerce settings' => 'Defnyddiwch label casglu lleol o osodiadau WooCommerce','When enabled, the pickup option label on checkout matches the title from WooCommerce pickup location settings. When disabled, the label uses the translatable "Local pickup" text from Fluid Checkout.' => 'Pan gaiff ei alluogi, mae&#39;r label opsiwn casglu wrth y ddesg dalu yn cyfateb i&#39;r teitl o osodiadau lleoliad casglu WooCommerce. Pan gaiff ei analluogi, mae&#39;r label yn defnyddio&#39;r testun &quot;Casglu lleol&quot; y gellir ei gyfieithu o Fluid Checkout.','Migration class %s must implement get_migration_steps().' => 'Rhaid i&#39;r dosbarth mudo %s weithredu get_migration_steps().','Migration class %s returned an empty get_migration_steps() list.' => 'Dychwelodd y dosbarth mudo %s restr wag get_migration_steps().','Checkout design customization' => 'Addasu dyluniad y ddesg dalu','Make your checkout pages match your brand, without custom CSS.' => 'Gwnewch i&#39;ch tudalennau talu gyd-fynd â&#39;ch brand, heb CSS personol.','Change the style of the header, footer, steps, sections, order summary, cart items and coupons.' => 'Newidiwch arddull y pennawd, y droedyn, y camau, yr adrannau, crynodeb archeb, eitemau&#39;r fasged a&#39;r cwponau.','Change the style of buttons and form fields.' => 'Newid arddull botymau a meysydd ffurflen.','Preview your changes on checkout, cart, thank you, and order pay pages before saving them.' => 'Rhagolwgwch eich newidiadau ar dudalennau talu, basged, diolch, a thalu archeb cyn eu cadw.','Set separate colors for light and dark mode.' => 'Gosodwch liwiau ar wahân ar gyfer modd golau a thywyll.','Design' => 'Dylunio','Some changes to the database are required.' => 'Mae angen rhai newidiadau i&#39;r gronfa ddata.','New settings page 🎉' => 'Tudalen gosodiadau newydd 🎉','Fluid Checkout has a redesigned settings experience with guided setup, live page previews, and easier navigation. Open settings to explore the new layout and discover new ways to configure your checkout.' => 'Mae gan Fluid Checkout brofiad gosodiadau wedi&#39;i ailgynllunio gyda gosodiad dan arweiniad, rhagolygon tudalen byw, a llywio haws. Agorwch y gosodiadau i archwilio&#39;r cynllun newydd a darganfod ffyrdd newydd o ffurfweddu eich proses dalu.','Go to settings' => 'Ewch i osodiadau','Since Fluid Checkout 5.0, settings are saved differently. Your settings have been migrated but legacy options are still stored in the database.' => 'Ers Fluid Checkout 5.0, mae gosodiadau&#39;n cael eu cadw&#39;n wahanol. Mae eich gosodiadau wedi cael eu mudo ond mae opsiynau etifeddol yn dal i gael eu storio yn y gronfa ddata.','Your store has been running for at least 2 months on the new settings so these legacy options can now be cleaned from the database. Please note that after cleanup, if you need to downgrade to previous versions of the plugin it will use default values for all settings.' => 'Mae eich siop wedi bod yn rhedeg am o leiaf 2 fis ar y gosodiadau newydd felly gellir glanhau&#39;r opsiynau etifeddol hyn o&#39;r gronfa ddata nawr. Nodwch, ar ôl glanhau, os oes angen i chi israddio i fersiynau blaenorol o&#39;r ategyn, y bydd yn defnyddio gwerthoedd diofyn ar gyfer pob gosodiad.','Fluid Checkout legacy settings cleanup' => 'Glanhau gosodiadau etifeddol Fluid Checkout','Usage tracking is optional and off by default. It helps us improve compatibility and support. You can preview the exact data before it is sent, and turn it off at any time.' => 'Mae olrhain defnydd yn ddewisol ac wedi&#39;i ddiffodd yn ddiofyn. Mae&#39;n ein helpu i wella cydnawsedd a chefnogaeth. Gallwch chi ragweld y data union cyn iddo gael ei anfon, a&#39;i ddiffodd ar unrhyw adeg.','When you turn it on, Fluid Checkout receives your site domain and basic environment details: WordPress, PHP and WooCommerce versions, language, store country, currency and timezone, your active theme, and your installed plugins and their versions. You can also choose to include monthly order counts and sales totals. No customer or user data is ever sent.' => 'Pan fyddwch chi&#39;n ei droi ymlaen, mae Fluid Checkout yn derbyn manylion parth eich safle a&#39;ch amgylchedd sylfaenol: fersiynau WordPress, PHP a WooCommerce, iaith, gwlad y siop, arian cyfred a pharth amser, eich thema weithredol, a&#39;ch ategion wedi&#39;u gosod a&#39;u fersiynau. Gallwch hefyd ddewis cynnwys cyfrifon archebion misol a chyfansymiau gwerthiant. Ni anfonir unrhyw ddata cwsmeriaid na defnyddwyr byth.','Keep it OFF' => 'Cadwch ef I FFWRDD','Review usage tracking' => 'Adolygu olrhain defnydd','Turn on usage tracking' => 'Troi olrhain defnydd ymlaen','Design customizations without code' => 'Addasiadau dylunio heb god','Express checkout from supported payment methods' => 'Talu cyflym o ddulliau talu a gefnogir','Choose a color for %s' => 'Dewiswch liw ar gyfer %s','Clear %s' => 'Clirio %s','Clear' => 'Clirio','Enter a valid CSS value.' => 'Rhowch werth CSS dilys.','Get faster support and help us improve compatibility and measure impact. Usage tracking is optional and off by default. <a href="%s">Review usage tracking</a> in the tools settings. You can preview the data and turn it off at any time.' => 'Cael cymorth cyflymach a&#39;n helpu i wella cydnawsedd a mesur effaith. Mae olrhain defnydd yn ddewisol ac wedi&#39;i ddiffodd yn ddiofyn. <a href="%s">Adolygwch olrhain defnydd</a> yn y gosodiadau offer. Gallwch chi ragweld y data a&#39;i ddiffodd ar unrhyw adeg.','Preview data' => 'Rhagolwg data','General styles for the checkout steps, order summary and other sections. Applies to the checkout and add payment method pages. With PRO, also applies to the cart, order pay, thank you (order received) and view order pages.' => 'Arddulliau cyffredinol ar gyfer y camau talu, crynodeb archeb ac adrannau eraill. Yn berthnasol i&#39;r tudalennau talu ac ychwanegu dull talu. Gyda PRO, mae hefyd yn berthnasol i&#39;r tudalennau basged, talu archeb, diolch (archeb wedi&#39;i derbyn) a gweld archeb.','Color scheme' => 'Cynllun lliw','Use the light or dark colors on the checkout pages, or use the dark colors only when the theme is in dark mode.' => 'Defnyddiwch y lliwiau golau neu dywyll ar y tudalennau talu, neu defnyddiwch y lliwiau tywyll dim ond pan fydd y thema mewn modd tywyll.','Theme' => 'Thema','Light' => 'Golau','Dark' => 'Tywyll','Change the checkout layout to multi-step to see these options.' => 'Newidiwch gynllun y ddesg dalu i aml-gam i weld yr opsiynau hyn.','Display the checkout progress bar' => 'Dangoswch y bar cynnydd wrth dalu','Customers can create an account from checkout while placing their order.' => 'Gall cwsmeriaid greu cyfrif o&#39;r ddesg dalu wrth osod eu harcheb.','Help guests finish checkout faster and create an account after they buy. Account matching associates guest orders with existing accounts, and delayed account creation lets customers register from the thank you page.' => 'Helpu gwesteion i orffen talu&#39;n gyflymach a chreu cyfrif ar ôl iddyn nhw brynu. Mae paru cyfrifon yn cysylltu archebion gwesteion â chyfrifon presennol, ac mae creu cyfrifon wedi&#39;i ohirio yn caniatáu i gwsmeriaid gofrestru o&#39;r dudalen ddiolch.','Configure customer account options' => 'Ffurfweddu opsiynau cyfrif cwsmer','The change could not be saved. Please try again.' => 'Ni ellid cadw&#39;r newid. Rhowch gynnig arall arni.','Settings navigation' => 'Mordwyo gosodiadau','This setting has moved to %s.' => 'Mae&#39;r gosodiad hwn wedi symud i %s.','another page' => 'tudalen arall','Dismiss the message of %s' => 'Diystyru neges %s','Dismissed.' => 'Wedi&#39;i ddiswyddo.','Undo?' => 'Dadwneud?','Optional, and off by default. It helps us improve compatibility and provide you with faster support. You can preview the exact data before it is sent, and turn it off at any time. No customer or user data is ever sent.' => 'Dewisol, ac i ffwrdd yn ddiofyn. Mae&#39;n ein helpu i wella cydnawsedd a rhoi cymorth cyflymach i chi. Gallwch chi gael rhagolwg o&#39;r data union cyn iddo gael ei anfon, a&#39;i ddiffodd ar unrhyw adeg. Ni anfonir unrhyw ddata cwsmeriaid na defnyddwyr byth.','Nothing is sent right away unless you choose to send it. After that, usage data is sent about once a week, or about every 4 weeks if nothing has changed.' => 'Ni anfonir dim ar unwaith oni bai eich bod yn dewis ei anfon. Ar ôl hynny, anfonir data defnydd tua unwaith yr wythnos, neu tua phob 4 wythnos os nad oes dim wedi newid.','Basic environment' => 'Amgylchedd sylfaenol','Included whenever usage tracking is on. WordPress, PHP and WooCommerce versions, language, store country, currency and timezone, your active theme, and your installed plugins and their versions, including whether each plugin is active. Also your site domain, whether this is a multisite, and when Fluid Checkout plugins were first activated. A paid Fluid Checkout plugin can include a hashed license key, not the key itself.' => 'Wedi&#39;i gynnwys pryd bynnag y bydd olrhain defnydd ymlaen. Fersiynau WordPress, PHP a WooCommerce, iaith, gwlad y siop, arian cyfred a pharth amser, eich thema weithredol, a&#39;ch ategion wedi&#39;u gosod a&#39;u fersiynau, gan gynnwys a yw pob ategyn yn weithredol. Hefyd parth eich safle, a yw hwn yn aml-safle, a phryd y cafodd ategion Fluid Checkout eu actifadu gyntaf. Gall ategyn Fluid Checkout taledig gynnwys allwedd drwydded wedi&#39;i hasio, nid yr allwedd ei hun.','The active Fluid Checkout settings you have selected.' => 'Y gosodiadau Gwirio Hylif gweithredol rydych chi wedi&#39;u dewis.','These settings are not sent yet.' => 'Nid yw&#39;r gosodiadau hyn wedi&#39;u hanfon eto.','Store totals' => 'Cyfansymiau&#39;r siop','Monthly order counts and sales totals for processing and completed orders, for finished months only. The first send can include the 12 months before you installed Fluid Checkout and each finished month since then. No customer or order details are included.' => 'Cyfrifon archebion misol a chyfansymiau gwerthiant ar gyfer archebion prosesu ac archebion wedi&#39;u cwblhau, ar gyfer misoedd gorffenedig yn unig. Gall yr anfoniad cyntaf gynnwys y 12 mis cyn i chi osod Fluid Checkout a phob mis gorffenedig ers hynny. Ni chynhwysir unrhyw fanylion cwsmer na gorchymyn.','Legacy settings' => 'Gosodiadau etifeddiaeth','Since Fluid Checkout 5.0, settings are stored in profiles. Legacy individual option rows may still exist in the database from older versions to allow downgrades to a pre-5.0 plugin version.' => 'Ers Fluid Checkout 5.0, mae gosodiadau wedi&#39;u storio mewn proffiliau. Gall rhesi opsiynau unigol etifeddol fodoli yn y gronfa ddata o fersiynau hŷn i ganiatáu israddio i fersiwn ategyn cyn 5.0.','Legacy settings cleanup' => 'Glanhau gosodiadau etifeddol','Remove leftover individual option rows after you no longer need to downgrade to a pre-5.0 plugin version.' => 'Tynnwch resi opsiynau unigol sy&#39;n weddill ar ôl nad oes angen i chi israddio i fersiwn ategyn cyn 5.0 mwyach.','Clean legacy settings' => 'Glanhau gosodiadau etifeddiaeth','Address book integration' => 'Integreiddio llyfr cyfeiriadau','VAT number' => 'Rhif TAW','Define limit of VAT Numbers a customer can save to their account.' => 'Diffinio terfyn y Rhifau TAW y gall cwsmer eu cadw i&#39;w gyfrif.','One per account' => 'Un fesul cyfrif','One per address entry' => 'Un fesul cofnod cyfeiriad','Usage data preview' => 'Rhagolwg data defnydd','This is the exact usage data that would be sent with your current choices.' => 'Dyma&#39;r union ddata defnydd a fyddai&#39;n cael ei anfon gyda&#39;ch dewisiadau cyfredol.','Loading preview...' => 'Wrthi&#39;n llwytho rhagolwg...','Could not load the preview. Try again.' => 'Methwyd llwytho&#39;r rhagolwg. Rhowch gynnig arall arni.','Could not send the usage data. Try again.' => 'Methwyd anfon y data defnydd. Rhowch gynnig arall arni.','Usage data sent.' => 'Data defnydd wedi&#39;i anfon.','Turn on and send now' => 'Trowch ymlaen ac anfonwch nawr','Usage data is already being sent. Try again in a moment.' => 'Mae data defnydd eisoes yn cael ei anfon. Rhowch gynnig arall arni mewn eiliad.','Usage tracking is turned off.' => 'Mae olrhain defnydd wedi&#39;i ddiffodd.','There is no usage data to send.' => 'Nid oes data defnydd i&#39;w anfon.','This site cannot send usage data. Local and development sites are excluded.' => 'Ni all y wefan hon anfon data defnydd. Mae gwefannau lleol a gwefannau datblygu wedi&#39;u heithrio.','Usage data was sent recently. Try again later.' => 'Anfonwyd data defnydd yn ddiweddar. Rhowch gynnig arall arni yn nes ymlaen.','The usage data could not be sent. Try again later.' => 'Ni ellid anfon y data defnydd. Rhowch gynnig arall arni yn nes ymlaen.','Usage tracking is not available.' => 'Nid yw olrhain defnydd ar gael.','There is no usage data for these choices.' => 'Nid oes data defnydd ar gyfer y dewisiadau hyn.','You are not allowed to manage usage tracking.' => 'Ni chaniateir i chi reoli olrhain defnydd.','Get only this add-on' => 'Cael yr ychwanegiad hwn yn unig','Usage tracking is turned off by the %s constant in wp-config.php.' => 'Mae olrhain defnydd wedi&#39;i ddiffodd gan y cysonyn %s yn wp-config.php.','Physical products' => 'Cynhyrchion ffisegol','Downloads & Digital products' => 'Lawrlwythiadau a chynhyrchion digidol','Services' => 'Gwasanaethau','Bookings' => 'Archebion','Subscriptions' => 'Tanysgrifiadau','Memberships' => 'Aelodaethau','Shipping to address' => 'Llongau i&#39;r cyfeiriad','Pickup in store or at a location' => 'Casglu yn y siop neu mewn lleoliad','Ship to pickup point' => 'Llongau i&#39;r man casglu','Local delivery' => 'Dosbarthu lleol','DTC - Direct to consumer' => 'DTC - Yn uniongyrchol i&#39;r defnyddiwr','B2B - To businesses' => 'B2B - I fusnesau','your country' => 'eich gwlad','Only in %s' => 'Dim ond mewn %s','Multiple countries' => 'Gwledydd lluosog','Fashion, apparel, and accessories' => 'Ffasiwn, dillad ac ategolion','Health and beauty' => 'Iechyd a harddwch','Electronics and computers' => 'Electroneg a chyfrifiaduron','Food and drink' => 'Bwyd a diod','Home, furniture, and garden' => 'Cartref, dodrefn, a gardd','Education and learning' => 'Addysg a dysgu','Sports and recreation' => 'Chwaraeon a hamdden','Arts and crafts' => 'Celf a chrefft','Other' => 'Arall','Please select what type of products or services you sell.' => 'Dewiswch pa fath o gynhyrchion neu wasanaethau rydych chi&#39;n eu gwerthu.','Please select who you sell to.' => 'Dewiswch i bwy rydych chi&#39;n gwerthu.','Please select where your customers are located.' => 'Dewiswch ble mae eich cwsmeriaid wedi&#39;u lleoli.','Please enter a valid email address for the newsletter.' => 'Rhowch gyfeiriad e-bost dilys ar gyfer y cylchlythyr.','Please select at least one product type.' => 'Dewiswch o leiaf un math o gynnyrch.','Please select at least one delivery method for physical products.' => 'Dewiswch o leiaf un dull dosbarthu ar gyfer cynhyrchion ffisegol.','About your store' => 'Ynglŷn â&#39;ch siop','Products & delivery' => 'Cynhyrchion a chyflenwi','Recommended setup' => 'Gosodiad a argymhellir','Show recommendations already applied' => 'Dangos argymhellion sydd eisoes wedi&#39;u cymhwyso','Hide recommendations already applied' => 'Cuddio argymhellion sydd eisoes wedi&#39;u cymhwyso','Show more recommendations' => 'Dangos mwy o argymhellion','Show fewer recommendations' => 'Dangos llai o argymhellion','Welcome to Fluid Checkout!' => 'Croeso i Fluid Checkout!','It is great to have you here with us! We will be guiding you through the setup process – your answers to a few questions will help us recommend checkout settings for your store.' => 'Mae&#39;n wych eich cael chi yma gyda ni! Byddwn yn eich tywys trwy&#39;r broses sefydlu – bydd eich atebion i ychydig o gwestiynau yn ein helpu i argymell gosodiadau talu ar gyfer eich siop.','What type of products or services do you sell?' => 'Pa fath o gynhyrchion neu wasanaethau ydych chi&#39;n eu gwerthu?','Who do you predominantly sell to?' => 'I bwy ydych chi&#39;n gwerthu yn bennaf?','Where are your customers located?' => 'Ble mae eich cwsmeriaid wedi&#39;u lleoli?','Help improve Fluid Checkout with optional usage tracking (no customer data).' => 'Helpu i wella Fluid Checkout gydag olrhain defnydd dewisol (dim data cwsmeriaid).','You can review and change this anytime under Tools → Usage tracking.' => 'Gallwch adolygu a newid hyn unrhyw bryd o dan Offer → Olrhain defnydd.','Email address' => 'Cyfeiriad e-bost','Newsletter opt-in' => 'Optio i mewn i&#39;r cylchlythyr','Opt-in to receive news about new features, tips and recommendations from the Fluid Checkout team directly in your inbox.' => 'Dewiswch dderbyn newyddion am nodweddion, awgrymiadau ac argymhellion newydd gan dîm Fluid Checkout yn uniongyrchol yn eich mewnflwch.','What do you sell, and how do you deliver physical products?' => 'Beth ydych chi&#39;n ei werthu, a sut ydych chi&#39;n dosbarthu cynhyrchion ffisegol?','What do you sell?' => 'Beth wyt ti&#39;n ei werthu?','How do you handle delivery of your products?' => 'Sut ydych chi&#39;n ymdrin â danfon eich cynhyrchion?','Recommended checkout settings' => 'Gosodiadau talu a argymhellir','No more recommendations to apply.' => 'Dim rhagor o argymhellion i&#39;w cymhwyso.','Show already applied' => 'Dangos sydd eisoes wedi&#39;i gymhwyso','Based on what you told us, these checkout options are a good starting point. You can turn recommended options off before applying them.' => 'Yn seiliedig ar yr hyn a ddywedoch chi wrthym, mae&#39;r opsiynau talu hyn yn fan cychwyn da. Gallwch ddiffodd yr opsiynau a argymhellir cyn eu rhoi ar waith.','You can change any of these settings later in the Fluid Checkout settings.' => 'Gallwch newid unrhyw un o&#39;r gosodiadau hyn yn ddiweddarach yng ngosodiadau Fluid Checkout.','Apply settings & finish setup' => 'Cymhwyso gosodiadau a gorffen y gosodiad','Your recommended setup options have been applied.' => 'Mae eich opsiynau gosod a argymhellwyd wedi&#39;u cymhwyso.','Test your checkout process and return to Fluid Checkout settings to adjust any settings if needed.' => 'Profwch eich proses dalu a dychwelwch i osodiadau Fluid Checkout i addasu unrhyw osodiadau os oes angen.','You can use the built-in live preview in settings to see how settings changes affect your checkout before saving them.' => 'Gallwch ddefnyddio&#39;r rhagolwg byw adeiledig yn y gosodiadau i weld sut mae newidiadau i osodiadau yn effeithio ar eich proses dalu cyn eu cadw.','If you need help, <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">contact our support team</a>.' => 'Os oes angen help arnoch, <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">cysylltwch â&#39;n tîm cymorth</a> .','Subscription account creation' => 'Creu cyfrif tanysgrifio','Allow subscription customers to create an account during checkout' => 'Caniatáu i gwsmeriaid tanysgrifiad greu cyfrif yn ystod y ddesg dalu','Enable account creation at checkout for subscription purchases when account creation for other orders is disabled.' => 'Galluogi creu cyfrif wrth y ddesg dalu ar gyfer pryniannau tanysgrifiad pan fydd creu cyfrif ar gyfer archebion eraill wedi&#39;i analluogi.','Multi-step checkout' => 'Talu aml-gam','Clear steps with few fields at a time to guide customers through checkout and keep them focused.' => 'Camau clir gyda rhai meysydd ar y tro i arwain cwsmeriaid trwy&#39;r broses dalu a&#39;u cadw&#39;n ffocws.','Single-step checkout' => 'Talu un cam','Show all fields at once. Ideal for short checkouts such as digital products or services that don\'t require much information.' => 'Dangoswch bob maes ar unwaith. Yn ddelfrydol ar gyfer prosesau talu byr fel cynhyrchion neu wasanaethau digidol nad oes angen llawer o wybodaeth arnynt.','Keep theme header and footer' => 'Cadwch bennawd a throedyn y thema','Show the store header and footer at checkout instead of the distraction-free layout. Useful for B2B stores that need site navigation during checkout.' => 'Dangoswch bennawd a throedyn y siop wrth y ddesg dalu yn lle&#39;r cynllun di-wrthdynnu. Yn ddefnyddiol ar gyfer siopau B2B sydd angen llywio&#39;r wefan wrth y ddesg dalu.','Edit cart at checkout' => 'Golygu&#39;r fasged wrth y ddesg dalu','Let customers change quantities and remove items without leaving checkout.' => 'Gadewch i gwsmeriaid newid meintiau a thynnu eitemau heb adael y til.','Billing before shipping' => 'Bilio cyn cludo','Collect the billing address as a step before shipping so business buyers can enter invoice details first.' => 'Casglwch y cyfeiriad bilio fel cam cyn cludo fel y gall prynwyr busnes nodi manylion yr anfoneb yn gyntaf.','Shipping methods before address' => 'Dulliau cludo cyn cyfeiriad','Show shipping methods before the address so customers can see other delivery options such as local pickup.' => 'Dangoswch ddulliau cludo cyn y cyfeiriad fel y gall cwsmeriaid weld opsiynau dosbarthu eraill fel casglu lleol.','Shipping methods after address' => 'Dulliau cludo ar ôl cyfeiriad','Ask for the shipping address first, then show shipping methods that match that destination.' => 'Gofynnwch am y cyfeiriad cludo yn gyntaf, yna dangoswch ddulliau cludo sy&#39;n cyfateb i&#39;r gyrchfan honno.','Require billing company' => 'Gofyn am gwmni bilio','Make the billing company field required so invoices include a company name for business orders.' => 'Gwnewch y maes cwmni bilio yn ofynnol fel bod anfonebau&#39;n cynnwys enw cwmni ar gyfer archebion busnes.','Hide additional order notes' => 'Cuddio nodiadau archeb ychwanegol','Hide the additional order notes field to keep checkout shorter. Customers rarely need it for most orders.' => 'Cuddiwch y maes nodiadau archeb ychwanegol i gadw&#39;r broses dalu&#39;n fyrrach. Anaml y bydd ei angen ar gwsmeriaid ar gyfer y rhan fwyaf o archebion.','Enable optimized cart page' => 'Galluogi tudalen y fasged wedi&#39;i optimeiddio','Improved cart page to reduce cart abandonment rates and give customers a consistent experience.' => 'Tudalen basged well i leihau cyfraddau gadael basged a rhoi profiad cyson i gwsmeriaid.','Enable optimized thank you page' => 'Galluogi tudalen diolch wedi&#39;i optimeiddio','Improved thank you page to give customers a consistent experience.' => 'Tudalen ddiolch wedi&#39;i gwella i roi profiad cyson i gwsmeriaid.','Enable optimized order pay page' => 'Galluogi tudalen talu archeb wedi&#39;i optimeiddio','Improved order pay page to give customers a consistent experience.' => 'Tudalen talu archebion wedi&#39;i gwella i roi profiad cyson i gwsmeriaid.','Suggest verified addresses as customers type to reduce typos and failed deliveries.' => 'Awgrymwch gyfeiriadau wedi&#39;u gwirio wrth i gwsmeriaid deipio i leihau camgymeriadau teipio a danfoniadau aflwyddiannus.','Address book at checkout' => 'Llyfr cyfeiriadau wrth y ddesg dalu','Let logged-in customers pick 